	"Welcome to the Commander's Challenge! Each of the dozens of battles ahead has its own rules of engagement. Choose to command Soviet, Allied, or Imperial forces in any challenge. Your goal is to vanquish your enemies.\n\n∙ Only basic forces will be available to you at first. Unlock an advanced arsenal by completing challenges!\n\n∙ Each victory unlocks new challenges, including side challenges leading to some of the best unlocks.\n\n∙ Battling adds to your emergency credit stash. Click the flashing button that appears in the heat of battle to draw credits from the stash!\n\nDo you have what it takes to conquer the final challenge and every side challenge? Maybe so...but only the world's greatest commanders could achieve all this under the posted par times. Good hunting!"
End

