APT:Y01_OVERVIEW
	"Somewhere in the arteries of a vast Imperial research facility, an unusual young woman awakens from a long and terrible slumber fraught with nightmares she knows were real..."
End

APT:Y02_OVERVIEW
	"More bloodshed awaited Yuriko after her failed escape attempt. In her defiant act, the Imperial Shogunate found evidence of the Omega Program's successes. So they gave her a new surname, a psychic dampener that controlled her temper, and a job defending her nation's front lines. And there she failed again.\n\nNow she suddenly regains her senses. She is disoriented and freezing, and above all, angry."
End

APT:Y03_OVERVIEW
	"Yuriko never wanted to see this place again, though she had no choice but to return. She reassures herself that this will be the last time. And then she prepares to smash through the roof. This was never her home, nor would it be her sister's."
End

