DESC:ABILITYALLIEDBASEDEFENSEEVACUATE
	"Unloads the turret's occupant and reverts to standard all-purpose configuration."
End

DESC:ABILITYANTIINFANTRYINFANTRYBONZAI
	"Powers on a beam katana that provides a brief burst of speed and can slice through infantry."
End

DESC:ABILITYCIVILIANSTRUCTUREEVACUATE
	"Vacates the structure of any garrisoned infantry in a calm, orderly fashion."
End

DESC:ABILITYDISGUISEDEVACUATE
	"Unloads any infantry inside, causing the Sudden Transport's disguise to shut off."
End

DESC:ABILITYEVACUATEALL
	"Unloads the passenger of the IFV and reverts to the standard weapon configuration."
End

DESC:ABILITYJAPANENGINEERSPRINT
	"Begins running with shameful abandon for a while. Causes fatigue, ridicule."
End

DESC:ABILITYJAPANSCOUTINFANTRYBOMB
	"Initiates countdown to fiery sacrifice. May cause collateral damage and grief."
End

DESC:ABILITYPACKUPALLIEDMCV
	"Converts to a Mobile Construction Vehicle, which may then redeploy to new locations."
End

DESC:ABILITYPACKUPJAPANMCV
	"Converts to a Mobile Construction Vehicle, which may then reposition as necessary."
End

DESC:ABILITYPACKUPSOVIETMCV
	"Converts to a Mobile Construction Vehicle, which may lumber off to greener pastures."
End

DESC:ABILITYPARADROP
	"Kicks any infantry out of the Century Bomber. Don't worry, they get parachutes."
End

DESC:ABILITYREPAIRVEHICLE
	"Naval vessels are gradually repaired to full strength when near these sub-structures."
End

DESC:ABILITYSOVIETANTIGROUNDAIRCRAFTEVACUATE
	"Drops off any infantry riding in the passenger cabin or vehicles hanging in tow."
End

DESC:ABILITYSOVIETBATTLEBUNKEREVACUATEALL
	"Release any troops crammed inside, trading protection for mobility and cleaner air."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKALLIEDMCV
	"Converts to a Construction Yard, which builds all sorts of military structures."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKALLIEDMINER
	"Begins converting to a Command Hub, so that other structures can be built nearby."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKJAPANBARRACKSEGG
	"Initiates nano-unfurling sequence, converting to an Instant Dojo in seconds."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKJAPANBASEDEFENSEADVANCEDEGG
	"Initiates nano-unfurling sequence, converting to a Wave-Force Tower in seconds."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKJAPANBASEDEFENSEEGG
	"Initiates nano-unfurling sequence, converting to a Defender-VX in seconds."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKJAPANMCV
	"Transforms to a Construction Yard, which can create other military structures."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKJAPANNAVALYARDEGG
	"Initiates nano-unfurling sequence, converting to the Imperial Docks in seconds."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKJAPANPOWERPLANTEGG
	"Initiates nano-unfurling sequence, converting to an Instant Generator in seconds."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKJAPANREFINERYEGG
	"Initiates nano-unfurling sequence, converting to an Ore Refinery in seconds."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKJAPANSUPERWEAPONADVANCEDEGG
	"Initiates nano-unfurling sequence, converting to the Psionic Decimator in seconds."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKJAPANSUPERWEAPONEGG
	"Initiates nano-unfurling sequence, converting to the Nanoswarm Hive in seconds."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKJAPANTECHSTRUCTUREEGG
	"Initiates nano-unfurling sequence, converting to a Nanotech Mainframe in seconds."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKJAPANWARFACTORYEGG
	"Initiates nano-unfurling sequence, converting to a Mecha Bay in seconds."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKSOVIETMCV
	"Unpacks into a Construction Yard, which assembles other military facilities."
End

DESC:ABILITYUNPACKSOVIETSURVEYOR
	"Begins converting to an Outpost, which enables other structures to build up nearby."
End

DESC:ACTIVATEMAGNETICARMOR
	"Supercharges defensive strength while drawing incoming fire. Cannot attack in the meantime."
End

DESC:ACTIVATEMAGNETICARMOROFF
	"Stops automatically absorbing all incoming fire in order to keep using the main gun."
End

DESC:ACTIVATEMIRAGEFIELD
	"Projects a camo field that cloaks friendly units. Cannot self-disguise or fire in this mode."
End

DESC:ACTIVATEMIRAGEFIELDOFF
	"Reverts to combat-and-ambush config. Gains unassuming camouflage when idle."
End

DESC:ACTIVATESHORTCIRCUIT
	"Radiates a disruption field that stops nearby enemy vehicles... and the Tesla Trooper."
End

DESC:ACTIVATESHORTCIRCUITOFF
	"Did you miss being able to shoot terrible bolts of lightning at your enemies?"
End

DESC:ACTIVATESHORTCIRCUITOFFTANK
	"Switches off the EM Disruptors in favor of being able to shoot terrible lightning once more."
End

DESC:ACTIVATESHORTCIRCUITTANK
	"Radiates a disruption field that stops nearby enemy vehicles... and the Tesla Tank."
End

DESC:ACTIVATESUPERSONICABILITY
	"Triggers a supersonic boost that can damage enemy fighters while avoiding fire."
End

DESC:ACTIVATETARGETPAINTER
	"Switches to using a targeting laser that makes foes much more vulnerable to attack."
End

DESC:ACTIVATETARGETPAINTEROFF
	"Switches to using the 90 mm smoothbore gun, which is effective against enemy armor."
End

DESC:AGGRESIVESTANCE
	"Units in Aggressive Stance will automatically fire on enemy structures as well as units, and will indefinitely pursue enemies."
End

DESC:AGGRESSIVESTANCE
	"Units in Aggressive Stance will automatically fire on enemy structures as well as units, and will indefinitely pursue enemies."
End

DESC:AIASSAULTDIRECTIVE
	"Select a location: Your ally will build up forces to eliminate foes there and along the way."
End

DESC:AIHOLDOBJECTDIRECTIVE
	"Select an enemy: Your ally will immediately send forces to deal with it and other hostiles there."
End

DESC:AIHOLDPOSITIONDIRECTIVE
	"Select a location: Your ally will immediately send forces to regroup there and hold it down."
End

DESC:AINORMALDIRECTIVE
	"Your ally will command autonomously: This cancels any other orders you've given."
End

DESC:AIRCRAFTQUEUECONSOLE
	"Manage all Air unit build queues."
End

DESC:AIRCRAFTSUBTAB
	"Manage individual Aircraft production structures."
End

DESC:AIRCRAFTTAB
	"Manage all Aircraft build queues."
End

DESC:AIRPORTTECHBUILDING
	"Capture this structure with an Engineer and all your aircraft will automatically self-repair!"
End

DESC:ALLIEDAIRFIELD
	"The Allies depend on these structures for building and servicing a variety of aircraft."
End

DESC:ALLIEDAIRFIELDRETURNTOBASE
	"Orders any aircraft that were docked at this Airbase to turn back and head home."
End

DESC:ALLIEDANTIAIRSHIP
	"Light, fast-moving vessels that patrol the seas in search of bogeys in the skies."
End

DESC:ALLIEDANTIAIRVEHICLETECH1
	"Jack-of-all-trades vehicles with adaptive weapons that change based on their passenger."
End

DESC:ALLIEDANTIGROUNDAIRCRAFT
	"Tough close-support aircraft that excel at tactical strikes against enemy ground forces."
End

DESC:ALLIEDANTIGROUNDAIRCRAFTRETURNTOAIRFIELD
	"Causes the Vindicator to hightail it back to an Airbase to repair and rearm."
End

DESC:ALLIEDANTIINFANTRYINFANTRY
	"Tough frontline infantry who defend their cause with shotguns and bulletproof shields."
End

DESC:ALLIEDANTIINFANTRYVEHICLE
	"Air-cushioned transport vehicles armed with heavy machine guns and anti-ship torpedoes."
End

DESC:ALLIEDANTIINFANTRYVEHICLEABILITY
	"Drops off any infantry riding inside, so they can join the fight. Usable only on land."
End

DESC:ALLIEDANTINAVALSCOUT
	"Graceful marine mammals bred for military service. Their sonic weapons can shake ships apart."
End

DESC:ALLIEDANTINAVYSHIPTECH1
	"Massive, state-of-the-art vessels that can take plenty of punishment at sea or on land."
End

DESC:ALLIEDANTISTRUCTURESHIP
	"Veritable floating fortresses presiding over entire squadrons of air-to-surface combat drones."
End

DESC:ALLIEDANTISTRUCTUREVEHICLE
	"Siege weapons linked to orbital satellites that can smite targets with deadly precision."
End

DESC:ALLIEDANTIVEHICLEINFANTRY
	"Seasoned soldiers ready to take on armor and aircraft with their missile launchers."
End

DESC:ALLIEDANTIVEHICLEVEHICLETECH1
	"Stalwart battle tanks that can effectively repel enemy armor and pinpoint vulnerabilities."
End

DESC:ALLIEDANTIVEHICLEVEHICLETECH3
	"High-tech tanks equipped with camo-projectors and spectrum cannons that can boil metal."
End

desc:AlliedArtilleryVehicle
	"Absolute hell rains down once these field artillery vehicles unpack their Grand Cannons."
End

DESC:ALLIEDBARRACKS
	"The Allies' infantry divisions stand ready to be deployed from these military structures."
End

DESC:ALLIEDBASEDEFENSE
	"All-purpose defense systems whose weapon changes if an infantry unit is ordered inside."
End

DESC:ALLIEDBASEDEFENSEADVANCED
	"High-tech security systems that use supercharged beams of light to stop enemy ground forces."
End

DESC:ALLIEDBOMBERAIRCRAFT
	"Stately, well-armored planes that can carpet-bomb enemy bases before sending in paratroopers."
End

DESC:ALLIEDCOMMANDOTECH1
	"A peerless soldier who can take on small armies with her dual pistols and explosives."
End

DESC:ALLIEDCONSTRUCTIONYARD
	"Allied field HQ. They enable production and grant tech clearance to nearby facilities."
End

DESC:ALLIEDCRANE
	"Cranes parallelize Construction Yards' production capability, letting them build two structures at once."
End

DESC:ALLIEDDISRUPTORSTATION
	"The Allies are daring to use this device to disrupt the Empire's global command network."
End

DESC:ALLIEDENGINEER
	"These brainy, defenseless specialists are useful for capturing or repairing structures."
End

DESC:ALLIEDENGINEERHEALTOGGLE
	"Unpacks a makeshift triage center that automatically heals nearby infantry."
End

DESC:ALLIEDENGINEERHEALTOGGLEOFF
	"Stuffs medical supplies back into briefcase to resume Engineerish responsibilities."
End

DESC:ALLIEDFIGHTERAIRCRAFT
	"Ultrafast air-superiority jets whose rapid-fire weapons can cut hostile aircraft to ribbons."
End

DESC:ALLIEDFIGHTERAIRCRAFTRETURNTOAIRFIELD
	"Causes the Apollo Fighter to hightail it back to an Airbase to repair and rearm."
End

DESC:AlliedFutureTank
	"Hulking unmanned war machines whose neutron scramblers can annihilate entire tank platoons."
End

DESC:AlliedFutureTankLaserWeapon
	"Fires ultrahigh-energy beams toward a target point, likely incinerating anything in the way."
End

desc:AlliedGunshipAircraft
	"Some Allied officials strongly protested the charter of these enormous heavy-support aircraft."
End

DESC:ALLIEDINFILTRATIONINFANTRY
	"Unarmed-and-dangerous saboteurs who break into bases while disguised as other infantry."
End

DESC:ALLIEDLEGIONNAIREINFANTRY
	"Ice-cold experimental soldiers boasting the latest powered armor and cryo weaponry."
End

DESC:ALLIEDMARINE1
	"Pres. Ackerman's private helicopter is always on standby to whisk him wherever he pleases."
End

DESC:ALLIEDMCV
	"Sophisticated vehicles used for setting up self-powered production centers."
End

DESC:ALLIEDMINER
	"Unarmed vehicles needed for gathering precious ore and setting up forward bases."
End

DESC:ALLIEDNAVALYARD
	"The Allies' renowned naval forces may be requisitioned and repaired at these structures."
End

DESC:ALLIEDNAVALYARDREPAIRBAY
	"Attach a Service Depot, whose drones attempt to automatically restore nearby ships to full strength."
End

DESC:ALLIEDOUTPOST
	"Converted from Prospectors, these facilities allow other Allied structures to be built nearby."
End

DESC:ALLIEDPOWERPLANT
	"These structures safely use clean-burning, sustainable fuels to power Allied bases."
End

DESC:ALLIEDRADARDISH
	"Radar Dishes feed real-time data to Battlefield Control's tactical minimap."
End

DESC:ALLIEDREFINERY
	"Prospectors deliver loads of valuable ore to these structures for processing and accounting."
End

DESC:ALLIEDSALVAGESHIP
	"This harmless old barge is used to extract data from shipwrecks. It is vital to this mission."
End

DESC:ALLIEDSCIENCELAB
	"Mykonos Laboratories is home to the Allies' advanced weapons research, and must be captured."
End

DESC:ALLIEDSCOUTINFANTRY
	"Alert, well-trained German Shepherds with lethal bites. Can sniff out enemy spies."
End

DESC:ALLIEDSUPERWEAPON
	"Uses temporal technology to mass-transport units to a target destination. Lethal to infantry."
End

DESC:ALLIEDSUPERWEAPONADVANCED
	"Spins up a furious energy beam that engulfs an area in a molecule-melting chain reaction."
End

DESC:ALLIEDSUPPLYPORT
	"The Allies are somehow using this facility to organize fleet movements in Lake Geneva."
End

DESC:ALLIEDSUPPORTAIRCRAFT
	"High-tech helicopters that can quell dangerous situations by freezing or shrinking hostiles."
End

DESC:ALLIEDTECHSCRAMBLER
	"This signal-scrambling device must be destroyed to unlock all units authorized for use here."
End

DESC:ALLIEDTECHSTRUCTURE
	"The Allies use these structures to supervise deployment of their top-secret defenses."
End

DESC:ALLIEDTIMEBOMBLVL1
	"A volatile explosive on a short fuse. Best to stay away from it if possible."
End

DESC:ALLIEDTIMEBOMBLVL2
	"A highly volatile explosive on a short fuse. Best to stay away from it if possible."
End

DESC:ALLIEDTIMEBOMBLVL3
	"An extremely volatile explosive on a short fuse. Best to stay away from it if possible."
End

DESC:ALLIEDVIPBUNKER
	"A high-ranking Allied commander is inside this facility, personally conducting the battle."
End

DESC:ALLIEDWALLPIECE
	"Place two such slabs in a row to raise thick walls that can impede enemy troops."
End

DESC:ALLIEDWARFACTORY
	"Factories certified to build and repair all vehicle models meeting the Allies' high standards."
End

DESC:AMPHIBIOUS
	"» Amphibious"
End

DESC:ArcherArrowBarrageSpecialPower
	"Fires a specially-armed arrow that bursts into white-hot, infantry-shredding spikes."
End

DESC:ASSAULTMOVE
	"Selected units will move to the desired location, attacking any enemy units or enemy structures along the way.\n\nLeft-click icon then right-lock on target location."
End

DESC:ATTACKMOVE
	"Selected units will move to the desired location and attack any enemies along the way.\n\nLeft-click icon then right-click on target location."
End

DESC:ATTRIBUTECRATE
	"Order a unit to get this conveniently-situated device to boost its attributes."
End

DESC:BARKSPECIALPOWER
	"Stuns nearby enemy infantry with a deafening yalp. May then maul with impunity."
End

DESC:BASEDEFENSETRANSFORMSPECIALPOWER
	"Switches to anti-air configuration, which automatically fires on enemy aircraft."
End

DESC:BASEDEFENSETRANSFORMSPECIALPOWEROFF
	"Switches to anti-surface configuration, which automatically fires on enemy land or sea units."
End

DESC:BASEMAGNETICSATELLITEEFFECT
	"Move this powerful beam over enemy vehicles and watch as they helplessly fly into space!"
End

DESC:BigMamaStatue
	"This crass monument represents the hopes of dreams of millions of Soviet citizens."
End

DESC:BOMBCRATE
	"Consider thinking twice before greedily ordering your units to open this volatile container."
End

DESC:BOOKMARKSTAB
	"Create groups of units"
End

DESC:BRIBESPECIALPOWER
	"Persuades nearby hostiles to turn coats for a low, low price. Who says loyalty can't be bought?"
End

DESC:BRIDGEGATEHOUSE
	"Order an Engineer into one of these to instantly repair the bridge next to it."
End

DESC:BRIDGESECTION
	"Cross impassable terrain via this thoughtfully-situated expanse, or destroy it to bar passage."
End

DESC:BUILDALLIEDCRANE
	"Attach a Crane, which enables construction of two structures at once."
End

DESC:BUILDALLIEDRADARDISH
	"Attach a Radar Dish, which feeds real-time data to Battlefield Control's tactical minimap."
End

DESC:BUILDSOVIETCRANE
	"Attach a Crane, which can build production structures independently of the Construction Yard."
End

DESC:BUILDSOVIETRADARDISH
	"Attach a Radar Dish, which enables the tactical minimap feature of the Battlefield Control interface."
End

DESC:CAMPAIGNPLAYERPOWERPARADROPLVL1
	"Call for airborne infantry support to paradrop precisely where needed!"
End

DESC:CAMPAIGNPLAYERPOWERPARADROPLVL2
	"Call for extra airborne infantry support to paradrop precisely where needed!"
End

DESC:CAMPAIGNPLAYERPOWERPARADROPLVL3
	"Call for maximum airborne infantry support to paradrop precisely where needed!"
End

DESC:CIVILIANBUILDINGGARRISONABLE
	"Infantry may hole up in here for protection and will automatically attack approaching foes."
End

DESC:COMMUNICATORTAB
	"Issue various orders to your Co-Commander to better plan joint strategies."
End

DESC:CONSTRUCTSOVIETBUNKERSPECIALPOWER
	"Erects a formidable bunker for a nominal fee, which infantry can garrison for protection."
End

DESC:CONTEXTUALTAB
	"Manage selected units or structures."
End

DESC:CONTROLGROUPSTAB
	"Manage Control Groups to access all your units by type."
End

DESC:ConventionCenter
	"Allied leaders were planning a counter-offensive when they were pinned inside here."
End

DESC:COOPAIASSAULTBUTTON
	"Select a location: Your ally will build up forces to eliminate foes there and along the way."
End

DESC:COOPAIHOLDOBJECTBUTTON
	"Select an enemy: Your ally will immediately send forces to deal with it and other hostiles there."
End

DESC:COOPAIHOLDPOSITIONBUTTON
	"Select a location: Your ally will immediately send forces to regroup there and hold it down."
End

DESC:COOPAINORMALBUTTON
	"Your ally will command autonomously: This cancels any other orders you've given."
End

DESC:CRYOLEAPSPECIALPOWER
	"Launches feet-first towards a target point, damaging or shattering any foes in the area."
End

DESC:DEACTIVATEMISSIONHOTSPOTSBUTTON
	"Your ally will immediately break off the current tactic and resume acting autonomously."
End

DESC:DEFENSIVESTRUCTURETECHBUILDING
	"Capture this structure with an Engineer and it will automatically engage nearby hostiles!"
End

DESC:DesolatorWeaponMode
	"Switches to firing globs of armor-corroding filth. Rinse with Deathspray for best results."
End

DESC:DesolatorWeaponModeOff
	"Switches back to spraying streams of poisonous fluids, which can melt flesh and bone."
End

DESC:EALA
	"The space-time continuum could be irreparably damaged should this studio come to harm."
End

DESC:EASTERISLANDDEFENSE
	"These mysterious statues solmenly bear witness to the historic conflict brewing here."
End

DESC:EJECTPASSENGERSSPECIALPOWER
	"Sends troops flying to the target area using the famous Hlopushka man-cannon."
End

DESC:EMPCRUISEMISSLESPECIALPOWER
	"Launches a special warhead that temporarily disables any electrical systems in the vicinity."
End

DESC:EMPERORSONSTATUE
	"Crown Prince Tatsu is immortalized in this statue, which the Allies seek to destroy."
End

DESC:EMPERORSTATUE
	"The Allied savages are daring to attack this proud statue of His Eminence the Emperor."
End

DESC:EmperorsTomb
	"Here lies the late Emperor Yoshiro, who inspires fierce loyalty even in death."
End

DESC:EUROPECOASTALGUN
	"Old but effective defenses that have fallen into disrepair. Your Engineers can fix that."
End

DESC:EXPLODINGBARREL
	"Why on earth would someone place this highly-volatile cannister here of all places?"
End

DESC:FASTFORWARD
	"Speeds up replay playback, hastening glorious victories and crushing defeats."
End

DESC:FI_FLOATINGFORTRESSMAINGUN
	"Devastating main guns found only on Empire of the Rising Sun's floating island fortresses."
End

DESC:FLOATINGFORTRESSPOWERCORE
	"The Empire left these power cores exposed, ill-expecting the enemy to ever draw anywhere near."
End

DESC:FORCEATTACK
	"Selected units will fire at friend, foe, or ground until told to stop--useful for bombarding into the fog-of-war.\n\nLeft-click icon then right-click on target."
End

DESC:FORCEMOVE
	"Units will move to the target location even if it's occupied by an enemy--useful for crushing smaller enemies.\n\nLeft-click icon then right-click on target location."
End

DESC:FUTURETECH
	"Destiny demands the destruction of this defense firm, which created the Chronosphere."
End

DESC:GARAGETECHSTRUCTURE
	"Capture this structure with an Engineer and all your vehicles will automatically self-repair!"
End

DESC:GE_SWISSBANK
	"Send an Engineer into this establishment to persuade its managers to fund your campaign."
End

DESC:GIBRALTARHANGAR
	"The Empire claimed these hangars, and uses them to coordinate air raids on nearby nations."
End

DESC:GROUNDEDEXPLOSIVEBOMBER
	"An old bomber that was put out to pasture yet remains full of highly-explosive fuels."
End

DESC:GroundedExplosiveFighter
	"One of the Empire's dual-form jets, grounded and vulnerable to attack..."
End

DESC:GUARDSTANCE
	"Units in Guard Stance will automatically move to engage nearby enemy units, and will return to their positions afterwards."
End

DESC:HARPOONSPECIALPOWER
	"Switches from the main guns to the Magnetic Harpoon, which draws in vehicles for the kill."
End

DESC:HARPOONSPECIALPOWEROFF
	"Switches to dual 125mm Drakon HEAT cannons, which can devastate any known armor."
End

DESC:HEALINGCRATE
	"Order a unit to crack open this crack to instantly heal it and any friends nearby. Science!"
End

DESC:HEIDELBERGCASTLE
	"This once-proud castle is now a Soviet command HQ. Regrettably, it must be destroyed."
End

DESC:HERMITAGE
	"Priceless works of art and other cultural treasures are housed inside this enormous museum."
End

DESC:HOLDFIRESTANCE
	"Units in Hold Fire Stance will not fire on enemies unless explicitly ordered to do so, which may be useful for ambush tactics."
End

DESC:HOLDGROUNDSTANCE
	"Units in Hold Ground Stance will automatically attack enemies that close within range, but will not move to engage."
End

DESC:HOSPITALTECHBUILDING
	"Capture this structure with an Engineer and all your infantry will automatically self-heal!"
End

DESC:IMPERIALADMINBUILDING
	"The Empire constructed this decadent palace as a symbol of its rule over the Soviet Union."
End

DESC:IMPERIALHARBORBUILDING
	"The Imperial navy relies on these structures for maintaining and tracking its armadas."
End

DESC:INFANTRYGROUP
	"Select all infantry in the field"
End

DESC:INFANTRYQUEUECONSOLE
	"Manage all Infantry build queues."
End

DESC:INFANTRYSUBTAB
	"Manage individual Infantry production structures."
End

DESC:INFANTRYTAB
	"Manage all Infantry build queues."
End

DESC:INFILTRATEDDISABLE
	"» Structure Infiltrated! Production temporarily offline."
End

DESC:INFILTRATEDENERGY
	"» Structure Infiltrated! Power grid temporarily down."
End

DESC:INFILTRATEDRADARFREEZE
	"» Structure Infiltrated! Radar temporarily offline."
End

DESC:INFILTRATEDVISION
	"» Structure Infiltrated! Enemy has line-of-sight."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIAIRSHIP
	"Elusive anti-air vessels invisible to enemy radar until they surface to strike, or to fly."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIAIRSHIP_AIR
	"Flying submarines that can cut through infantry in droves before diving back to the depths."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIAIRSHIPTRANSFORM
	"Switches to the flying Sky-Wing form, which provides anti-personnel close air support."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIAIRSHIPTRANSFORMOFF
	"Switches to submersible configuration to make aircraft feel most disagreeable."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIAIRVEHICLE_AIR
	"Rocket-spewing helicopters that can lay waste to most anything on the ground."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIAIRVEHICLETECH1
	"Versatile pilot-assisted robots that can repel aerial foes or rain death from the skies."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIAIRVEHICLETECH1TRANSFORM
	"Takes to the skies in the Chopper-VX configuration, which can assault surface targets."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIAIRVEHICLETECH1TRANSFORMOFF
	"Touches down to take on aerial threats in the ground-based Striker-VX configuration."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIINFANTRYINFANTRY
	"The Emperor's fanatical infantry legions fight with kinetic carbines and beam katanas."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIINFANTRYVEHICLE
	"Fast-moving, pilot-assisted robots that can assault by land or sea or turboboost to the skies."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIINFANTRYVEHICLE_AIR
	"Swift air-superiorty fighters that are even more maneuverable than their ground forms."
End

DESC:JAPANANTISTRUCTURESHIP
	"Proud, gigantic warships armed with six main battery guns that can devastate targets from afar."
End

DESC:JAPANANTISTRUCTURESHIPRAMMINGSPEED
	"Supercharges engines' top speed, such that enemy ships can be pulverized on contact."
End

DESC:JAPANANTISTRUCTUREVEHICLE
	"Mobile siege units that channel staggering amounts of energy into focused long-range strikes."
End

DESC:JAPANANTISTRUCTUREVEHICLEFIREKICANNON
	"Bypasses the normally-slow firing sequence for an immediate-yet-less-potent attack."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIVEHICLEINFANTRY
	"Steely-cold warriors whose personal plasma-cutter cannons can slice through enemy armor."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIVEHICLEINFANTRYTECH3
	"Deadly women warriors clad in jet-powered assault suits armed with photon rocket arrays."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIVEHICLESHIP
	"Specialized ship-hunters bristling with torpedo tubes that can launch along several vectors."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIVEHICLEVEHICLETECH1
	"Aggressive mainline tanks of the Japanese Empire, capable of traversing sea as well as land."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIVEHICLEVEHICLETECH1ENERGIZEDARMOR
	"Boosts defensive strength by temporarily diverting nanomachines from the main gun."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIVEHICLEVEHICLETECH3
	"Dread battlewalkers that can make short work of their victims in any number of ways."
End

DESC:JAPANANTIVEHICLEVEHICLETECH3RUSHATTACK
	"Charges the enemy head-on, smashing into or simply crushing any foes along the way."
End

DESC:JapanArcherInfantry
	"Rejected from the Rocket Angel ranks, these women sought to fight by more-traditional means."
End

DESC:JAPANBALLOONBOMBBALLOON
	"These air-dropped bombs use remote-guidance systems to find their targets!"
End

DESC:JAPANBARRACKS
	"Self-folding martial-arts centers in which Japan's infantry rigorously train for battle."
End

DESC:JAPANBARRACKSEGG
	"Special drones that unfurl into the Instant Dojo, which trains all Imperial infantry."
End

DESC:JAPANBASEDEFENSE
	"Fixed gun emplacements featuring both anti-personnel and anti-aircraft firing configurations."
End

DESC:JAPANBASEDEFENSEADVANCED
	"Stationary guns whose superheated energy salvoes can disintegrate terrestrial threats."
End

DESC:JAPANBASEDEFENSEADVANCED_FIREKICANNON
	"Bypasses the normally-slow firing sequence for an immediate-yet-less-potent attack."
End

DESC:JAPANBASEDEFENSEADVANCEDEGG
	"Special drones that unfurl into the Wave-Force Tower, a powerful stationary weapon."
End

DESC:JAPANBASEDEFENSEEGG
	"Special drones that unfurl into the Defender-VX, a variable gun emplacement."
End

DESC:JAPANCOMMANDHQ
	"This is the hub of the Empire of the Rising Sun's entire military intelligence network."
End

DESC:JAPANCOMMANDOTECH1
	"Vengeful survivor-graduate of a secret paramilitary telekinetic research program."
End

DESC:JAPANCONSTRUCTIONYARD
	"Nucleus of a Rising Sun base. They produce military structure cores for deployment as needed."
End

DESC:JAPANCONSTRUCTIONYARDEGG
	"Heart of any Japan base. They assemble military structures and may pack up into MCVs."
End

DESC:JAPANECONOMICSTRUCTUREEGG
	"Economic. ...."
End

DESC:JAPANEMPEROR
	"The Emperor of Japan stands proudly, greeting destiny with his head held high."
End

DESC:JAPANEMPERORMECHA
	"The original King Oni was too costly to mass-produce, yet it was superior to the later model."
End

DESC:JAPANENGINEER
	"Insufferable, unfit men whose value lies in their ability to capture or repair structures."
End

DESC:JapanFortressShip
	"Self-aware sea fortresses filled with unconscionable weapon systems and other dark secrets."
End

DESC:JapanFortressShip_Air
	"Incredible, hopelessly destructive flying siege weapons--symbols of the Empire's defiance."
End

DESC:JapanFortressShipEgg
	"Special drones that unfurl into the Giga-Fortress, a massive and heavily-armed warship."
End

DESC:JapanFortressShipEggUnpackSpecialPower
	"Initiates transformation sequence into the massive Giga-Fortress. Must be on water."
End

DESC:JapanFortressShipTransformAircraftMode
	"Switches to aerial form, whose infamous Gods' Breath device could tear the Earth asunder."
End

DESC:JapanFortressShipTransformShipMode
	"Switches back to floating form, whose myriad weapons could make the seas boil over."
End

DESC:JAPANINFILTRATIONINFANTRY
	"Master assassins who kill silently with their blades and wreak havoc inside enemy structures."
End

DESC:JapanIzumi
	"Her quiet demeanor belies her firm grasp of telepathic powers"
End

DESC:JapanKenjiMecha
	"This brazen Imperial commander refuses to submit to Allied authorities and must be detained."
End

DESC:JAPANLIGHTTRANSPORTVEHICLE
	"Explosive hovercraft that can assume other vehicles' shape to sneak behind enemy lines."
End

DESC:JAPANLONGRANGERADAR
	"Capturing this structure with an Engineer will signal Tatsu's King Oni squad to fight for you."
End

DESC:JAPANMCV
	"Self-contained mobile factories reverse-engineered from less-advanced enemy counterparts."
End

DESC:JAPANMECHAKING
	"An enormous secret weapon made to overwhelm the Soviet Union. Absorbs Tesla energy."
End

DESC:JAPANMINER
	"The Rising Sun's resource vehicle conceals a rapid-fire threat deterrent system."
End

DESC:JAPANNAVALYARD
	"The Empire's indomitable fleets sail forth from and repair at these ornate facilities."
End

DESC:JAPANNAVALYARDEGG
	"Special drones that unfurl into the Imperial Docks, which builds naval vessels."
End

DESC:JAPANNAVALYARDREPAIRBAY
	"Repair Sub-Structure"
End

DESC:JAPANNAVYSCOUTSHIP
	"Compact submersibles armed with tiny torpedoes. Almost invisible until they surface to fire."
End

DESC:JAPANODESSASPECIALTRANSPORTVEHICLE
	"A modified Sudden Transport bearing special parts that will form some sort of new weapon."
End

DESC:JAPANOREMINERDEPLOYWEAPON
	"Flips the cargo hold to reveal an anti-personnel weapon that can repel enemy forces."
End

DESC:JAPANOREMINERDEPLOYWEAPONOFF
	"Packs up the heavy machine gun to resume ore-gathering operations."
End

DESC:JAPANPOWERPLANT
	"Imperial bases need these chemical-burning structures to maintain operational efficiency."
End

DESC:JAPANPOWERPLANTEGG
	"Special drones that unfurl into the Instant Generator, which powers Imperial bases."
End

DESC:JAPANPOWERPLANTTURBINE
	"Substantially increases the Instant Generator's output by accelerating the chemical process."
End

DESC:JAPANRADARDISH
	"Radar Dishes feed essential data to the tactical minimap in the Battlefield Control interface."
End

DESC:JAPANRADARSHIP
	"This defenseless vessel is equipped with long-range scanners and target-tracking systems."
End

DESC:JAPANREFINERY
	"Ore Collectors fund Japan's military by depositing resources at these processing plants."
End

DESC:JAPANREFINERYEGG
	"Special drones that unfurl into the Ore Refinery, which generates war funds."
End

DESC:JAPANROBOTICSLAB
	"The Empire's high-tech weapons R&D is centralized within this paramilitary firm."
End

DESC:JapanScientist
	"The Rising Sun's chief scientist in the field of psionics and other neurologic defenses."
End

DESC:JAPANSCOUTINFANTRY
	"Deceptively cute recon robots that can tamper with vehicles and detect disguised enemies."
End

DESC:JapanSentinelVehicle
	"Sentinels as cold and heartless as their pilots, built to cut down enemy tank divisions."
End

DESC:JAPANSUPERWEAPON
	"Sends billions of nanomachines to envelop an area for a short while, effectively sealing it off."
End

DESC:JAPANSUPERWEAPONADVANCED
	"Induces psionic cataclysms, more intense than any natural disaster on record."
End

DESC:JAPANSUPERWEAPONADVANCEDEGG
	"Special drones that unfurl into the Psionic Decimator, which invokes psionic cataclysms."
End

DESC:JAPANSUPERWEAPONEGG
	"Special drones that unfurl into the Nanoswarm Hive, which forms an impenetrable shield."
End

DESC:JAPANTECHSTRUCTURE
	"These grant access to new tech by updating nanomachines with classified firmware."
End

DESC:JAPANTECHSTRUCTUREEGG
	"Special drones that unfurl into the Nanotech Mainframe, which unlocks the latest tech."
End

DESC:JAPANVIPBUNKER
	"A high-ranking Imperial commander is inside this facility, personally directing the fight."
End

DESC:JAPANWALLPIECE
	"Placing two wall pieces in a row forms a concrete barrier that hinders enemies."
End

DESC:JAPANWARFACTORY
	"These facilities assemble and repair Imperial military vehicles, including flight-capable ones."
End

DESC:JAPANWARFACTORYEGG
	"Special drones that unfurl into the Mecha Bay, which assembles all Imperial vehicles."
End

Desc:JapanYurikoTech1
	"A distraught, disoriented young woman beginning to understand her extraordinary potential."
End

Desc:JapanYurikoTech2
	"Now fully-aware of her talents, she knew her foes would not live to regret taking her alive."
End

Desc:JapanYurikoTech3
	"Ungrateful for the psionic talents bestowed upon her, she nonetheless uses them to take revenge."
End

DESC:JUMPSPECIALPOWER
	"Leaps up and out of the water, possibly eluding surface attacks in the process."
End

DESC:KAMIKAZEATTACKSPECIALPOWER
	"Makes a beeline at an enemy with intent to crash into and destroy it. One use per Mini-Sub."
End

DESC:KAMIKAZEATTACKSPECIALPOWEROFF
	"Reverts from Destruct Mode, causing the Mini-Sub's crew, family, and ancestors much dishonor."
End

DESC:KenjiVilla
	"Commander Kenji has barricaded himself in his swanky estate, and must be flushed out."
End

DESC:KIROVSTADIUM
	"A former sports arena, gutted by the Soviets and converted into a preposterous bomber base."
End

DESC:KR_ARTILLERYDOME
	"The operators of this frightful, extreme-range cannon are expected to defend Odessa at all costs."
End

DESC:KREMLINHEART
	"The meddling Soviets' time-machine is contained in the bowels of this outlandish tower."
End

DESC:LAControlTower
	"The Allies are using this control tower to call in aerial reinforcements. Capture it."
End

DESC:LAMediaCenter
	"Capture these structures, and the Emperor's voice will be heard by millions more."
End

DESC:LaserGlaiveBlastSpecialPower
	"Slams the ground with violent energy that courses forward, consuming all in its path."
End

DESC:LASERMTRUSHMORE_JEFFERSON
	"This is but a hollow mockery of the principle author of the Declaration of Independence."
End

DESC:LASERMTRUSHMORE_LINCOLN
	"Perhaps it is for the best that 'Honest Abe' Lincoln cannot be here to witness this monstrosity."
End

DESC:LASERMTRUSHMORE_ROOSEVELT
	"The memory of T.R. is debased by this nefarious facade, which conceals a terrible weapon."
End

DESC:LASERMTRUSHMORE_WASHINGTON
	"The first American President surely would have frowned on this twisted take on his visage."
End

DESC:LAUNCHFORTRESS
	"This once-proud fortress has been gutted and turned into the Premier's escape route."
End

DESC:LeapDeploySpecialPower
	"Leaps up and crashes down on the target area or foe. Becomes entrenched and immobile."
End

DESC:LEAPSPECIALPOWER
	"Springs into or out of battle, onto higher ground, into crowds of infantry, and more."
End

DESC:LIBERTYSTATUE
	"The Allies' faith in their foolish ideology should fall along with this profane monument."
End

DESC:MAGNETICBOMBSPECIALPOWER
	"Switches to using thrown anti-vehicle explosives, which go off if the Flak Trooper is crushed."
End

DESC:MAGNETICBOMBSPECIALPOWEROFF
	"Switches to the Vorona Steelshot Flak Cannon, which is most effective against aircraft."
End

DESC:MECHAKINGSHOCKWAVESPECIALPOWER
	"Drives all three wave-force blades into the earth, causing mass destruction."
End

DESC:MEERAGETANK
	"With any luck, the Soviets will mistake this modified Mirage Tank for one of theirs..."
End

DESC:MESSENGER
	"View and communicate with participants in this battle."
End

DESC:MIRVSPECIALPOWER
	"Readies special ordnance that splits apart in flight, causing widespread damage."
End

DESC:MIRVSPECIALPOWEROFF
	"Readies standard ballistic ordnance that explodes on contact in an exact location."
End

DESC:MOLOTOVCOCKTAILSPECIALPOWER
	"Switches to improvised grenades packing an explosive punch. Garrisoned foes, beware."
End

DESC:MOLOTOVCOCKTAILSPECIALPOWEROFF
	"Switches to using the ADK-45 assault rifle, a cheap and fairly reliable firearm."
End

DESC:MONEYCRATE
	"Order a unit to get this helpful, conveniently-situated device for an instant influx of credits."
End

DESC:MTFUJIVIEWINGTOWER
	"The Emperor Yoshiro overlooks his palace grounds from within this ancient viewing tower."
End

DESC:MTRUSHMORE
	"Something is not right with the stern countenances of America's great leaders..."
End

DESC:MULTIPLAYERBEACON
	"Draws teammates' attention. Click the bubble to add a message. Remove by pressing Delete."
End

DESC:NAVYQUEUECONSOLE
	"Manage all Navy unit production."
End

DESC:NAVYSUBTAB
	"Manage individual Navy production structures."
End

DESC:NAVYTAB
	"Manage all Navy build queues."
End

DESC:NitrousBoostSpecialPower
	"Fires on all cylinders for a sudden burst of speed, useful for overtaking cowardly foes."
End

DESC:NONGARRISONABLESTRUCTURE
	"From a tactical point of view, whatever this is, it can be destroyed if it gets in the way."
End

DESC:NR_FuturetechMinitower
	"This military stockpile bears the markings of the Allies' preferred defense contractor."
End

DESC:NR_FUTURETECHSCIENCEBUILDING1
	"No telling how much overpaid, morally bankrupt corporate slime this place can hold."
End

DESC:NR_FUTURETECHSCIENCEBUILDING2
	"No good is likely to come of the sort of science conducted within these well-hidden walls."
End

DESC:NR_FUTURETECHSCIENCEBUILDING3
	"A global network of good-for-nothings stay in cahoots via these conferencing centers."
End

DESC:NR_FUTURETECHSCIENCEBUILDING4
	"Swanky housing intended for FutureTech's new hires, top execs, and richest clients."
End

DESC:NR_FutureTechWarFactory
	"Heavy-duty, high-tech facilities designed to churn out FutureTech's latest weapons of war."
End

DESC:NR_PowerPlnt
	"Capturing this facility will power down any FutureTanks and slow production of new ones."
End

DESC:NR_SigmaHarmonizer
	"Thornley conspired with FutureTech to construct this wildly dangerous, expensive eyesore."
End

DESC:NY_NYSTOCKEXCHANGE
	"Send a Combat Engineer into this facility to force its proprietors share their wealth."
End

DESC:OBJECTIVES
	"Review mission objectives and more!"
End

DESC:OBSERVATIONPOSTTECHBUILDING
	"Capture this structure with an Engineer to reveal much of the surrounding battlefield!"
End

DESC:ODESSACASTLE
	"Soviet citizens cherish this quaint little fort, which has stood for nearly a century."
End

DESC:ODESSACHURCH
	"The Soviets' prayers shall go unanswered once Tatsu's ultimate weapon is finished with it."
End

