DESC:PlayerPowerYurikoUpgradeHealth02
	"Shrugs off injuries that would normally cause death. Also affects psychic-dominated lackies.\n\nPassive Upgrade\nMax Health: +50%"
End

DESC:PlayerPowerYurikoUpgradeSpeed01
