MISSIONNAME:EP1_SOVIETS_4_SHORT
	"SIGMA ISLAND"
End

MISSIONNAME:EP1_YURIKO_1
	"SHIRO PSYCHIC RESEARCH - \"FINAL EXAM\""
End

MISSIONNAME:EP1_YURIKO_1_SHORT
	"SHIRO PSYCHIC RESEARCH\n"
End

MISSIONNAME:EP1_YURIKO_2
	"DETENTION CAMP DAKOTA - \"THE TRACELESS MASSACRE\""
End

MISSIONNAME:EP1_YURIKO_2_SHORT
	"DETENTION CAMP DAKOTA"
End

MISSIONNAME:EP1_YURIKO_3
	"SHIRO PSYCHIC RESEARCH - \"RUIN AND REUNION\""
End

MISSIONNAME:EP1_YURIKO_3_SHORT
	"SHIRO PSYCHIC RESEARCH (RENOVATED)"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1
	"Repair the Coastal Guns"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Those coastal guns will provide us with heavy artillery against the incoming Soviet naval forces. Capture them with an Engineer from your Barracks."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_BONUSOBJECTIVE_2
	"Capture the Hospital"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_BONUSOBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"Capturing the Hospital will cause all Allied infantry to slowly recover automatically."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_BONUSOBJECTIVE_3
	"Garrison Four Civilian Structures"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_BONUSOBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"The evacuated structures around Brighton may be garrisoned by your infantry for extra protection. Garrison the four designated structures before the Soviets send their next wave."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_BONUSOBJECTIVE_4
	"Train 5 Javelin Soldiers"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_BONUSOBJECTIVE_4_DESC
	"The Soviets are bringing in a naval force, which Peacekeepers will be ill-equipped to fend off. Train at least 5 Javelin Soldiers from your Boot Camp to help counter the Soviet navy."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_BONUSOBJECTIVE_5
	"Build 5 Multigunner IFVs"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_BONUSOBJECTIVE_5_DESC
	"You are authorized to build Multigunner IFVs at the Armor Facility. Build at least 5 IFVs before the Soviets arrive, to help fend them off."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Eliminate the Soviets in Brighton"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"A recon unit of war bears and Soviet conscripts are suppressing our forces in preparation for a full-scale assault on this region. Neutralize them."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Hold Out Against the Incoming Soviets"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"The Soviets are sending an aerial invasion force. They will likely be air dropping infantry at your location. Build up an amry of infantry to counter this invasion."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Repel the Soviet Navy"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"Soviet naval forces are inbound. Continue to hold off their forces by any means necessary. Use evacuated structures to your advantage."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_OBJECTIVE_4
	"Eliminate the Remaining Soviets"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A01_OBJECTIVE_4_DESC
	"The remainder of the Soviet forces are coming. Construct Multigunner IFVs to help bolster your army against this final wave of attack."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A02_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1
	"Neutralize the Defenses Guarding the Vindicators"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A02_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Allied support bombers have been grounded in this area. To recover them, take down the defenses guarding them using Tanya or Spies."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A02_HINT_BRIBE
	"You can use the Spy's Bribe special ability to gain control of these Conscripts."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A02_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Save the Allied Leaders"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A02_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Leaders of several Allied nations are being held hostage in the convention center. Eliminate the Soviet forces suppressing them."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A02_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Get Spies into the Port Buildings"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A02_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"Send an Allied Spy into each of the Soviet-held port structures. They will help set Agent Tanya's trap to eliminate the Soviet navy."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A02_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Get Tanya into the Port Authority Building"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A02_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"Once Spies have infiltrated each of the ports, getting Agent Tanya into the Port Authority should allow her to send a signal to lead the Soviet navy into a trap."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A02_OBJECTIVE_4
	"Sink the Soviet Dreadnoughts"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A02_OBJECTIVE_4_DESC
	"The heavy bombardment ships besieging the coast of Cannes need to be destroyed so that the Soviets can be routed from this area."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A02_OBJECTIVE_5
	"Wipe Out the Soviet Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A02_OBJECTIVE_5_DESC
	"Eliminating the Soviet commander's forces in this area should bring the city of Cannes back under the protection of the Allies."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A03_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1
	"Assist Agent Tanya"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A03_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Tanya is pinned down by Soviets forces. Defeat them and save her."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A03_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Escort the MCVs"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A03_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Defend the MCVs as they travel downriver. Beware of the Tesla Coils along the way."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A03_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Destroy Four Super-Reactors"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A03_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"The Soviets are using Super-Reactors to power their base defenses. Destroying at least four of the reactors should take the defenses offline."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A03_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Destroy the Soviet Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A03_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"The Union's last stronghold in Europe is this headquarters. It must be destroyed to drive the Soviets back to their land."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A03_OBJECTIVE_4
	"Destroy the Iron Curtain"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A03_OBJECTIVE_4_DESC
	"The enemy commander is using the Iron Curtain to make the Soviet headquarters invulnerable. The Iron Curtain must be destroyed."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A03_OBJECTIVE_5
	"Destroy the Soviet Headquarters"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A03_OBJECTIVE_5_DESC
	"The enemy commander is controlling his army from this location. Destroy it and end the Soviets' oppression over Europe."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A04_BONOBJ_2
	"Set Up an Expansion Base in the Southwest"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A04_BONOBJ_2_DESC
	"Unpack a Prospector into a Command Hub in the southwest area of Gibraltar near the unclaimed Ore Mine."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A04_BONOBJECTIVE_2
	"Tanya and Natasha Must Survive"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A04_BONOBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"Do not let the enemy overwhelm either of our commandos to help ensure this mission goes off without a hitch."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A04_BONUSOBJ_1
	"Eliminate the King Oni"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A04_BONUSOBJ_1_DESC
	"An Imperial King Oni is patrolling the Rock of Gibraltar in search of our assault forces. Our commandos should be able to deal with it."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A04_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Destroy the Hangars"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A04_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Neutralize the Empire-occupied hangars. Many grounded Imperial aircraft are refueling nearby, and may cause a chain reaction if destroyed."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A04_OBJECTIVE_1A
	"Destroy the Hangars"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A04_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Recover the Assault Destroyers"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A04_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"The Empire has several of our amphibious Assault Destroyers on lockdown. Eliminating the nearby defenses should free their crews."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A04_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Destroy the Imperial Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A04_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"The Empire is staging air raids and producing its pilot-assisted robots here in Gibraltar. Destroy their production facilities."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A05_BONOBJECTIVE_1
	"Destroy the Generators"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A05_BONOBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Use your Spies to infiltrate the enemy Generators. Natasha cannot advance until power to the guns has been cut."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A05_BONOBJECTIVE_2
	"Capture the Generators"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A05_BONOBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"Help Natasha clear a path for the Soviet Engineers. Only they can hack the Powerplants to cut power to the guns guarding the path to the Radar Ship."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A05_OBJ_1_DESC
	"The Salvage Ship is attempting to recover important intelligence about the Floating Island Fortress from the sunken Japanese ship. Protect it for as long as it takes to recover the information."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A05_OBJ_2_DESC
	"Once disguised, our Spies should be able to infiltrate the Generators to cut power to the defenses protecting the Radar Ship."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A05_OBJ_3_DESC
	"Lead the Soviet Combat Engineers to the Generators so they can hack the connections to the guns protecting the Radar Ship. With the guns offline, Tanya will have a clear path to the Radar Ship."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A05_OBJ_4_DESC
	"Use Engineers to destabilize the two reactors powering the Floating Island Fortress. Capturing both reactors should cause a chain reaction to destroy it."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A05_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Protect the Salvage Ship"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A05_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Destroy the First Radar Ship"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A05_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Capture Both Fortress Power Cores"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A05_OBJECTIVE_4
	"Destroy the Second Radar Ship"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_BONOBJECTIVE_1
	"Capture the Boot Camp"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_BONOBJECTIVE_1_HINT
	"Capturing the Boot Camp will prevent the President from calling in reinforcements close to you."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_BONOBJECTIVE_2
	"Capture the Jefferson Head Control Center"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_BONOBJECTIVE_2_HINT
	"Capturing this Head Control Center will disable the lasers in Thomas Jefferson."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_BONOBJECTIVE_3
	"Capture the Lincoln Head Control Center"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_BONOBJECTIVE_3_HINT
	"Capturing this Head Control Center will disable the lasers in Abraham Lincoln."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_BONOBJECTIVE_4
	"Capture the Washington Head Control Center"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_BONOBJECTIVE_4_HINT
	"Capturing this Head Control Center will disable the lasers in George Washington."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_BONOBJECTIVE_5
	"Destroy the Power Plant"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_BONOBJECTIVE_5_HINT
	"The Power Plant runs the enemy base defenses nearby."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_OBJ_1_DESC
	"Destroy the Communications Tower to prevent the President from transmitting the launch codes to the super weapon inside Mount Rushmore."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_OBJ_2_DESC
	"The President is on his way to the weapon Firebase. Destroy it before his limo gets there."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_OBJ_3_DESC
	"The President is attempting to flee. Destroy the vehicle he is riding in before he escapes."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Destroy the Com Tower"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Destroy the Rushmore Firebase"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A06_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Eliminate the President of the United States"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A07_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Hold out for Soviet Reinforcements"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A07_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Transport an MCV Across the Harbor"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A07_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Take Out the Imperial Military"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A07_OBJECTIVE_4
	"Sink Prince Tatsu's Fleet"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A07_OBJECTIVE_BONUS_1
	"Destroy the Imperial Blockade"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A07_OBJECTIVE_BONUS_1_DESC
	"The Soviets are on their way with reinforcements, though they need the Imperial defenses in the harbor eliminated in order to get here."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A08_BONUS1_DESC
	"Use the Spies' Bribe ability or some other means to get at least 10 Soviet combatants in your army."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A08_BONUS1_TITLE
	"Recruit a Force of 10 Soviets"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A08_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Investigate Havana for Soviet Activity"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A08_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Avoid detection while looking for signs of Soviet military activity here in Havana."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A08_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Locate a Soviet Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A08_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"Soviet presence in Havana confirmed. Continue to avoid detection while looking for a base of operations."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A08_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Destroy the Soviet Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A08_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"This previously-unknown Soviet base is already in disarray and too dangerous to be left standing."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A08_OBJECTIVE_4
	"Destroy the Kirov Launch Facilities"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A08_OBJECTIVE_4_DESC
	"The Soviets are launching long-range Kirov Airships toward numerous Allied cities. All the Kirov facilities must be destroyed."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A08_OBJECTIVE_5
	"Do Not Let a Kirov Leave Havana"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A08_OBJECTIVE_5_DESC
	"Each Kirov Airship here carries a payload that could devastate a city. Destroy all Kirovs before they escape and arm their bombs."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A09_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1
	"Destroy the Vacuum Imploder"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A09_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"The Soviet Union seeks to use its ultimate weapon against your forces. Destroy it before it can fire."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A09_OBJECTIVE_0A
	"Unpack MCV 1 at Chrono Drop Zone 1"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A09_OBJECTIVE_0A_DESC
	"Seize the opportunity to slip through Leningrad's defenses and unpack a Construction Yard at the designated Chrono Drop Zone."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A09_OBJECTIVE_0B
	"Unpack MCV 2 at Chrono Drop Zone 2"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A09_OBJECTIVE_0B_DESC
	"Rush past the Soviet defenses and unpack a Construction Yard at the designated Chrono Drop Zone."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A09_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Clear the Plateau of Soviets"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A09_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Use the Allied reinforcements to eliminate all enemies in the vicinity, so the assault on Leningrad can continue."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A09_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Destroy All Seven Iron Curtains"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A09_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"The Premier's fortress is protected by multiple Iron Curtains. Their effects are redundant, so all seven must be destroyed."
End

MISSIONOBJ:A09_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Destroy the Premier's Fortress"
End

MISSIONOBJ:A09_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"The Soviet Premier is attempting to escape the long arm of the law. Destroy his space shuttle and bring him to justice."
End

MISSIONOBJ:CAPTURE_VIP_BUNKERS
	"Capture the Soviet V.I.P. Bunkers"
End

MISSIONOBJ:DESTROY_TIME_MACHINE
	"Destroy the Time Machine"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A01_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Defend this Mobile Construction Vehicle by following the markers and eliminating any opposition along the way. Once you reach the designated point, you will gain control of our forward base."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A01_OBJECTIVE_1_TITLE
	"Escort the MCV to the Staging Area"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A01_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"Due to the nature of this mission, you must make sure the designated MCV safely reaches the designated point. If Shinzo's forces manage to destroy it, he will surely escape."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A01_OBJECTIVE_2_TITLE
	"The MCV Must Survive"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A01_OBJECTIVE_2p5_DESC
	"Shinzo's army must be stopped. These forces have sworn to fight against the Allied cause to the last, even if their master is detained."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A01_OBJECTIVE_2p5_TITLE
	"Defeat Shinzo's Loyalist Forces"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A01_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"Use Cryocopters or other cryo weapons at your disposal to freeze the House of Shinzo so that the warlord may be safely extracted. He must not be harmed; he is to be transported to Detention Center Dakota for questioning."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A01_OBJECTIVE_3_TITLE
	"Freeze the House of Shinzo"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A01_OBJECTIVE_4_DESC
	"Shinzo is attempting to flee in a Sudden Transport disguised as a Tsunami Tank. Use Cryocopters or other cryo weapons to freeze his transport before he can escape. Do not destroy the transport; Shinzo must be taken alive."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A01_OBJECTIVE_4_TITLE
	"Find and Freeze Shinzo's Disguised Transport"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A01_OBJECTIVE_B1_DESC
	"Some of Shinzo's forces know this rebellion is hopeless. Capture his Dojos for Prince Tatsu and they will be convinced to aid your cause in exchange for lighter sentences."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A01_OBJECTIVE_B1_TITLE
	"Capture the Nagama Dojos"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A02_BONOBJ_1_DESC
	"Prince Tatsu has requested your assistance in capturing the Imperial Instant Dojo and Mecha Bay indicated on the battlefield. He has promised to provide additional support in exchange."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A02_BONOBJ_1_TITLE
	"Capture the Instant Dojo and Mecha Bay"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A02_BONOBJ_2_DESC
	"Prince Tatsu asks that you repair the bridges in the area by sending Engineers into the Gatehouses. Once done, his forces will no longer be cut off and will be able to assist you."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A02_BONOBJ_2_TITLE
	"Repair the Bridges"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A02_BONOBJ_3_DESC
	"Win over the hearts and minds of the local population by repairing the buildings that were damaged leading up to the occupation of Japan."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A02_BONOBJ_3_TITLE
	"Repair the Damaged Buildings"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A02_OBJ_1_DESC
	"Several enhanced Nanoswarm Hives are barring passage to Kenji's headquarters. These shields are impenetrable and can be sustained for days, so you need to find a way to deactivate them."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A02_OBJ_1_TITLE
	"Deactivate the Nanoswarm Shields"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A02_OBJ_2_DESC
	"Now that the Nanoswarm Hives are down, the path to Kenji's headquarters is open. Fight your way to it and destroy it to flush Kenji out into the open."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A02_OBJ_2_TITLE
	"Destroy Kenji's HQ"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A02_OBJ_3_DESC
	"Kenji is using a reverse-engineered Tech Inhibitor against us. It is preventing you from constructing vehicles, and preventing us from capturing him via the Chronosphere. Destroy the Tech Inhibitor to re-enable our technology, and use the Cryo Legionnaires to freeze Kenji in place so that he can be sent to join Shinzo."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A02_OBJ_3_TITLE
	"Destroy the Tech Inhibitor and Freeze Kenji"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A03_OBJBONUS_DESC
	"Prince Tatsu will signal reserve forces to come to your aid, provided that you can successfully capture the abandoned radar facility in this area using an Engineer."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A03_OBJBONUS_TEXT
	"Capture the Abandoned Com Tower"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A03_OBJONE_DESC
	"Break through Commander Takara's front line with your available forces. Quickly set up a defensible position. We have identified two viable positions for your forward base."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A03_OBJONE_TEXT
	"Set Up a Base at Either Breach Point"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A03_OBJTHREE_DESC
	"Tatsu has turned--our trust in him was misplaced--and he has launched a full-scale counterattack. You are his first target. Defeat his army so that we might finally bring a lasting peace to the Empire of the Rising Sun."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A03_OBJTHREE_TEXT
	"Defeat Tatsu"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A03_OBJTWO_DESC
	"Neutralize the dissident forces sworn to the renegade Commander Takara, and put an end this bloody civil conflict."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_A03_OBJTWO_TEXT
	"Defeat Takara"
End

missionobj:ep1_j01_bonobj_1
	"Destroy the Soviet Outpost"
End

missionobj:ep1_j01_bonobj_1_desc
	"A small Outpost in this region is the staging area for Soviet reinforcements. Eliminating this Outpost should buy Commander Kenji's defense forces more time."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J01_Objective_1
	"Rendezvous with the Soviet Reinforcements"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J01_Objective_1_DESC
	"Disguise your Sudden Transport as a Soviet vehicle and blend in with one of their reinforcement waves. In their haste to attack Kenji's position, they may lead you straight to their vulnerable flanks."
End

missionobj:ep1_j01_objective_2
	"Capture the Soviet V.I.P. Bunker"
End

missionobj:ep1_j01_objective_2_desc
	"Use an Engineer to capture the Soviet V.I.P. Bunker to the northwest to transfer all Soviet facilities in the area to your control. This should significantly disrupt their plans."
End

missionobj:ep1_j01_objective_3
	"Destroy the Soviet Forward Base"
End

missionobj:ep1_j01_objective_3_desc
	"Use the Soviets' own forces against their forward base to put a decisive end to the assault on Commander Kenji's position."
End

missionobj:ep1_j01_objective_4
	"Destroy the Grinders"
End

missionobj:ep1_j01_objective_4_desc
	"The Soviets are using heavily-armored vehicles called Grinders against our forces in this region. Initial scans reveal that Grinders have significantly weaker rear armor. Eliminate them all."
End

missionobj:ep1_j01_objective_5
	"Commander Kenji Must Survive"
End

missionobj:ep1_j01_objective_5_desc
	"Eliminate the Soviet assault forces before they can overwhelm Commander Kenji's position. His base is all that stands between the Soviet barbarians and our mainland."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J02_BonusObj_1
	"The Emperor's Tomb Must Not Fall"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J02_BonusObj_1_DESC
	"Defend the Emperor's Tomb from the Soviet savages at all costs, for in it lies His Eminence, the late Emperor Yoshiro. His memory is what spurs the Imperial people to greater acts of glory even to this day."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J02_Objective_1
	"Steal the Allies' Vehicles"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J02_Objective_1_DESC
	"The Allies have ignored our pleas for aid against the incoming Soviets. So we will make them help us anyway. Order our warriors to take their vehicles, then use those vehicles to ambush the Soviets--after dealing with any Allied forces that retaliate."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J02_Objective_2
	"Garrison the Steel Ronins"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J02_Objective_2_DESC
	"The Steel Ronin have been sentenced to guard the Imperial Tombs for eternity. Order an infantry unit to go to each of them, so that the Steel Ronin may awaken and regain their honor in the coming battle."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J02_Objective_3
	"Sink the Soviet Navy"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J02_Objective_3_DESC
	"Destroy the Soviet's naval strike group before it makes its way down the channel and over to the Emperor's Tomb."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J02_Objective_4
	"Capture and Hold the Observation Posts"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J02_Objective_4_DESC
	"Use Engineers to capture each of the six Observation Posts in this region, and destroy any Soviets in their vicinity. Securing each of the islands should be enough to route the Soviet forces."
End

MissionObj:EP1_J02_Objective_5
	"Unpack a Pacifier at Each Ambush Point"
End

MissionObj:EP1_J02_Objective_5_DESC
	"Send the Allies' Pacifier vehicles to the designated strike points and use their special ability to deploy their artillery weapons. They will cripple the Soviet navy as it approaches."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J03_BonObj_2
	"Eliminate Commander Giles' Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J03_BonObj_2_DESC
	"It seems the Allies have finally taken an interest in these matters. Destroy their forces here, for they deserve no part of this. This battle is yours alone."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J03_Objective_1
	"Eliminate the Soviet Frontline Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J03_Objective_1_DESC
	"Bring ruin to the Soviet frontline base so that your forces may take up position on dry land, in order to press the assault."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J03_Objective_2
	"Defeat Commander Oleg"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J03_Objective_2_DESC
	"Commander Oleg's base is stationed along the coast of Vladivostok. Destroy his forces utterly to avenge the warriors who fell in the battle of Sakhalin."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J03_Objective_3
	"Defeat Commander Moskvin"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_J03_Objective_3_DESC
	"Commander Moskvin's base is stationed in the mountains of Vladivostok. Destroy his forces utterly to avenge the warriors who fell in the battle of Oki Island."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S01_OBJBONUS_DESC
	"Escort the Chief Scientists to harbor for extraction. As their knowledge is valuable, it would be best if all of them were to return home safely, so that they could get back to work for us."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S01_OBJBONUS_TEXT
	"Safely Extract All Chief Scientists"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S01_OBJONE_DESC
	"Our local resistance forces have taken note of unusual behavior by Allied affiliates in the region. Rendezvous with them at each of the indicated holdout points so that we may gain more insight into this situation."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S01_OBJONE_TEXT
	"Rendezvous with the Recon Teams"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S01_OBJTHREE_DESC
	"The Chief Scientists must know a great deal about whatever it was the Allies are planning. We need this information. Escort them back to harbor so that we may question them in a homelike environment."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S01_OBJTHREE_TEXT
	"Safely Extract At Least One Chief Scientist"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S01_OBJTWO_DESC
	"Several of Chief Scientists from the Ministry of Experimental Science, once presumed dead, appear to be working here against their will, on Allied weapons research no less.  Find them and rescue them."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S01_OBJTWO_TEXT
	"Rescue the Chief Scientists"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S02_BONUSOBJ01_DESC
	"Some of our bretheren are being held in labor camps in this area. Break in and free them, so that they might aid your mission and, perhaps, return home."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S02_BONUSOBJ01_TITLE
	"Liberate the Soviet Forces"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S02_BONUSOBJ02_DESC
	"We need to understand what this FutureTech Corp. was doing here. Capture their structures before destroying them so that we might benefit from the secrets held within."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S02_BONUSOBJ02_TITLE
	"Capture the FutureTech Facilities"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S02_OBJ01_DESC
	"Avoid the patrols to get to the hill overlooking the FutureTech Corp. research complex to learn more about what those dogs are scheming."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S02_OBJ01_TITLE
	"Scout the FutureTech Research Facility"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S02_OBJ02_DESC
	"Double back to the safety of the village, and garrison your troops in the buildings there. Hold your ground until reinforcements reach the area."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S02_OBJ02_TITLE
	"Regroup at the Village"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S02_OBJ03_DESC
	"Use all available resources to muster an army large enough to make your way to the FutureTech Corp. research complex, and completely destroy it. FutureTech's presence here is an intolerable offense."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S02_OBJ03_TITLE
	"Crush the FutureTech Research Facility"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S03_OBJBONUS_DESC
	"Destroying the FutureTech facilities here should significantly dampen the corporation's ability to continue manufacturing its weapons of war, which stand as a threat to the future of the Union."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S03_OBJBONUS_TEXT
	"Crush the FutureTech Facilities"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S03_OBJONE_DESC
	"You must make do with the small number of forces we could sneak in, and eliminate any Allied combatants you find at each of the outer islands here. Only then will we gain a foothold for the main offensive."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S03_OBJONE_TEXT
	"Clear Hostile Forces from the Outer Islands"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S03_OBJTHREE_DESC
	"FutureTech Corporation is building an entire army, using its military headquarters here as a staging area. Destroy all traces of FutureTech's facilities and military assets here."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S03_OBJTHREE_TEXT
	"Crush the FutureTech Military HQ"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S03_OBJTWO_DESC
	"Prospector vehicles are en route to the FutureTech headquarters with their stashes of valuable ore. Destroy them, before they reach their destinations, to claim their funds for our cause."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S03_OBJTWO_TEXT
	"Destroy the Prospectors"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S04_BONOBJ03_DESC
	"The FutureTech Weapons Plants contain information that may be invaluable to the speedy recovery of the Soviet Union. Capture the Weapons Plants using your Combat Engineers."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S04_BONOBJ03_TITLE
	"Capture the FutureTech Weapons Plants"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S04_BONUSOBJ01_DESC
	"The FutureTech Arsenals generate tremendous amounts of heat, and require the Cooling Towers on this island to function properly. Capturing the Cooling Towers with your Combat Engineers should not only slow FutureTank production, it should temporarily disable any FutureTanks in the field."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S04_BONUSOBJ01_TITLE
	"Capture the Cooling Towers"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S04_BONUSOBJ02_DESC
	"The enemy has the surrounding airspace on lockdown, using radar-jamming devices as well as air supriority. Crush their airbase to bring aircraft production online."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S04_BONUSOBJ02_TITLE
	"Destroy the Airbase Controlling the Skies"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S04_OBJ01_DESC
	"Our resistance forces are prepared to establish a beachhead on Sigma Island, and are expecting FutureTech to retaliate quickly and aggressively. Find a way to get your MCV to a defensible position on the island and unpack it into a Construction Yard to begin mustering heavy assault forces. Be ready for counterattack from any direction, for we know that FutureTech will not hesitate to use every available weapon to stop us, yet we do not know the full extent of their arsenal."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S04_OBJ01_TITLE
	"Establish a Base on Sigma Island"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S04_OBJ02_DESC
	"Sigma Island is the heart of FutureTech's weapons production, and its facilities here are working overtime on powerful, new machines built for war. Destroy any production facilities you find."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S04_OBJ02_TITLE
	"Destroy FutureTech's Production Capability"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S04_OBJ03_DESC
	"The Sigma Harmonizer is linked to a facility called the Harmonizer Control, which is powering up the rings even now. Crush the Harmonizer Control before the Sigma Harmonizer reaches full power."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_S04_OBJ03_TITLE
	"Stop the Sigma Harmonizer"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_Y02_Obj_1_Desc
	"Yuriko's priority is to find a way out of her detention cell. While her physical body is frozen like a statue, she still has some of her psionic abilities."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_Y02_Obj_1_Title
	"Escape From Cryo-Stasis"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_Y02_Obj_2_desc
	"Having escaped from her containment cell, the enraged Yuriko intends to completely demolish the Allied prison camp that held her captive for months."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_Y02_Obj_2_title
	"Utterly Destroy the Detention Camp"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_Y02_Obj_2A_Desc
	"Having devastated the Detention Camp, Yuriko is compelled to return to the Empire of the Rising Sun--specifically to Shiro Psychic Research--in order to take care of some unfinished business."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_Y02_Obj_2A_Title
	"Head Back to the Empire"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_Y02_Obj_3_Desc
	"An enemy armada is standing in Yuriko's way, and so she vows to send every last ship to the bottom of the sea."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_Y02_Obj_3_Title
	"Sink the Carrier Strike Groups"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_Y02_Obj_b1_dest
	"Yuriko can sense that the other prisoners held in this facility will fight their common enemies to the death for a chance at freedom."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_Y02_Obj_b1_title
	"Rescue the Frozen Prisoners"
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_Y02_Obj_b2_Desc
	"Yuriko is too weak from months spent in frozen captivity to fly across the broken bridge, though surely she could use her powers to persuade someone in the prison complex to repair it for her."
End

MISSIONOBJ:EP1_Y02_Obj_b2_Title
	"Repair the Bridge"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J01_BONOBJECTIVE_1
	"Destroy All of the Barracks"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J01_bonobjective_1_DESC
	"The Soviets are attempting to repel our invasion by mustering reinforcements from their Barracks. Smash them."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J01_BONOBJECTIVE_2
	"Destroy the War Factory"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J01_bonobjective_2_DESC
	"Soviet armor reinformcents in the area will be cut off with the destruction of their War Factory."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J01_BONOBJECTIVE_8
	"Bring Down the Tesla Coils"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J01_bonobjective_8_DESC
	"The Soviets' advanced base defenses are a serious threat. Either take out their power source or use your forces to destroy them."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J01_BONOBJECTIVE_9
	"Capture the Hospital"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J01_bonobjective_9_DESC
	"Use an Engineer to capture the local Hospital. It will cause our infantry to recover from their injuries gradually."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J01_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Destroy the Reactors"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J01_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Use the infantry inside the Sudden Transports to knock out power to the Tesla Coils. Strike quickly and the Emperor will reward you."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J01_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Destroy the Statues around the Square"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J01_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"Strike at the heart of Russia's morale by leveling the monuments dedicated to the Soviet people. Use Tankbusters and Final Squadrons to take the statues down quickly, but beware of patrols in the city."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J01_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Destroy the Soviet Navy at Harbor"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J01_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"Our Mini-Subs wait off the coast, ready to attack. Bring down the Tesla Coils guarding the Naval Yard by destroying them directly with Final Squadrons, or destroy the Reactors powering them to take them offline."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J02_BONUS_STATUES
	"Destroy All Soviet Monuments"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J02_ESTABLISH_BEACHEAD
	"Establish a Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J02_KILL_STATUE
	"Destroy the Mother Russia Statue"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J02_MCV_HINT
	"You can now build a Mobile Construction Vehicle. This will allow you to build more structures and expand your base."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J02_TECHUPGRADE_HINT
	"You can unlock the next set of units at your production structures by purchasing the tech upgrade from each structure."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J02_TRANSPORTS
	"Defend the Transports"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J03_ARTILLERY
	"Destroy the Artillery Batteries"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J03_BONUS_CULTURE_KILLER
	"Destroy the Landmarks"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J03_DESTROY_KRUKOV
	"Destroy the Soviet Bases"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J03_ESCORT_PARTS
	"Escort the Transports"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"The enemy is trying to capture our Long Range Radar Towers.  You must not let that happen."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1_TITLE
	"Defend the Long Range Radars"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_BONUSOBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"Aircraft Carriers are extremely effective siege weapons.  Pacify them swiftly."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_BONUSOBJECTIVE_2_TITLE
	"Destroy the Aircraft Carrier"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_BONUSOBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"Use engineers to bringing all of these stations online to enchance your battlefield control, giving you full vision of the battlefield."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_BONUSOBJECTIVE_3_TITLE
	"Capture the Long Range Radar Towers"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_BONUSOBJECTIVE_4_DESC
	"Are you skillful enough to protect three of these towers from the Allied invasion force?"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_BONUSOBJECTIVE_4_TITLE
	"The Monuments Must Not Fall"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Deploy Base Defenses Around the Harbor"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"These Monuments and Harbors represent the heart and industry of Pearl Harbor. Three of these must survive the Allied invasion, or all is lost."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_OBJECTIVE_3_TITLE
	"Defend Pearl Harbor"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_OBJECTIVE_4_DESC
	"These Harbors are very important to our military industrial complex.  Do not let the Allies destroy a single one!"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_OBJECTIVE_4_TITLE
	"Defend the Harbors"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_OBJECTIVE_5_ANNOUNCE
	"Emperor's Son returns with the fleet!  Destroy the Allies!"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_OBJECTIVE_5_DESC
	"The Allied invasion has failed!  Teach them the error of their ways, and eradicate the barbarians!"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J04_OBJECTIVE_5_TITLE
	"Destroy the Allies' Assault Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J05_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"The Allies are attempting to push their way to Tokyo. You must hold the line here in these waters. Not even a single MCV must leave this area."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J05_OBJECTIVE_1_TITLE
	"Stop the Allied MCVs"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J05_OBJECTIVE_2_COUNTDOWN
	"Bonus Objective Time Remaining:"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J05_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"The floating fortress is in peril. Repair it immediately by sending Engineers into its two Power Cores, and it should stabilize."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J05_OBJECTIVE_2_TITLE
	"Escort the Engineers to the Power Cores in 3 Minutes"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J05_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"The Engineers must repair the Power Cores to restore the Fortress to full power."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J05_OBJECTIVE_3_TITLE
	"Repair the Fortress Power Cores"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J05_OBJECTIVE_4_DESC
	"Should both Power Cores be destroyed, our floating fortress will be lost, and our homeland will be in grave danger."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J05_OBJECTIVE_4_TITLE
	"Protect the Fortress Power Cores"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J05_OBJECTIVE_5_DESC
	"The Allies have dared to attack our floating fortress, and cannot be forgiven for this offense. Destroy them all."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J05_OBJECTIVE_5_TITLE
	"Destroy the Allied Assault Forces"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J05_OBJECTIVE_BONUS_1_TITLE
	"Bonus objective TITLE placeholder."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J06_BONOBJECTIVE_2
	"Capture the International Airport"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J06_BONOBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"The Allies are using the International Airport here as a staging area for bombing runs. Capture the airport to stop their bombers."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J06_BONOBJECTIVE_3
	"Destroy the Observatory Cannon"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J06_BONOBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"The Observatory conceals a powerful defensive weapon. Destroy it or it will continue to slow the advance of our forces."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J06_BONOBJECTIVE_4
	"Destroy the Software Company"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J06_BONOBJECTIVE_4_DESC
	"This American software corporation is no match for its Japanese counterparts. Destroy its headquarters and teach its shareholders a lesson."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J06_BONOBJECTIVE_5
	"Destroy the Amusements"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J06_BONOBJECTIVE_5_DESC
	"The amusements on the Santa Monica pier displease the Emperor, who has requested that they be brought to ruin."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J06_OBJECTIVE_0
	"Clear a Landing Zone"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J06_OBJECTIVE_0_DESC
	"Annihilate the civilian structures on the coast of Santa Monica to clear the way for Imperial assault forces."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J06_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Capture the Media Centers"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J06_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Emperor Yoshiro requires the Media Centers in Santa Monica to spread his message. Capture them all using Engineers."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J07_BONUS_DESTROY_SOVIETS
	"Destroy the Soviet Forces"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J07_BONUS_SAVE_NANOSWARM
	"Capture the Nanoswarm Hives"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J07_OBJECTIVE_CAPTURE_OUTPOSTS
	"Retake the Forward Bases"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J07_OBJECTIVE_DEFEND_OUTPOSTS
	"Hold Out for Reinforcements"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J07_OBJECTIVE_DESTROY_RELAY_STATIONS
	"Destroy the Allied Relay Stations"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J08_OBJECTIVE_DESTROY_EVERYTHING
	"Destroy Everything"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J08_OBJECTIVE_DESTROY_EVERYTHING_ALT
	"Destroy All Soviet Forces and the Kremlin"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J08_OBJECTIVE_MECHAKING_MUST_LIVE
	"The Shogun Executioner Must Survive"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J08_OBJECTIVE_WAIT_FOR_MECHAKING
	"Await the Shogun Executioner"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J09_BONUS_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Neutralize the Proton Colliders"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J09_BONUS_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"The Allies are anxious to use their ultimate weapons in defense of their last military stronghold. Prevent this from happening."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J09_OBJECTIVE_0
	"Destroy the Allied Advance Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J09_OBJECTIVE_0_DESC
	"Destroy the Allies' forward base, as that land will then become the staging area for our final attack."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J09_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Destroy the Allied Air Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J09_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"The Allied Air Base threatens our mighty air force. Destroy it and take to the skies once more."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J09_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Destroy the Final Allied Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J09_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"Forces led by the Allies' Field Marshall Bingham are all that stands between us and final victory. Eliminate them."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J09_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Eliminate the Soviet Scientist"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J09_OBJECTIVE_3_ALT
	"Destroy the FutureTech HQ"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J09_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"The FutureTech headquarters is researching technology that threatens our very existence, and must be destroyed."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J09_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC_ALT
	"Do not let anything stand in the way of the destruction of the FutureTech headquarters."
End

MISSIONOBJ:J09_OBJECTIVE_4
	"Eliminate the FutureTech HQ Guards"
End

MISSIONOBJ:J09_OBJECTIVE_4_DESC
	"These Apocalypse Tanks are all that stand in our way. Destroy them!"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S01_BONUSOBJ2_DESC
	"Natasha is an expert swimmer. Order her into the canals to take aim at the Imperial Battleships, though beware their escort."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S01_BONUSOBJ2_TITLE
	"Take Natasha for a Swim"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S01_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1
	"Save the Hermitage"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S01_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Save the Hermitage by destroying all its attackers."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S01_OBJ2B_DES
	"Use Natasha or the Magnetic Satellite to destroy the ships."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S01_OBJ2B_TITLE
	"Destroy the Imperial Fleet"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S01_OBJECTIVE_01B
	"Train 5 Flak Troopers"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S01_OBJECTIVE_01B_DESC
	"Select the Barracks and train 5 Flak Troopers."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S01_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Secure the Fortress"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S01_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Fight your way towards the Fortress and eliminate any enemies there."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S01_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Protect the Fortress"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S01_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"Defend the Fortress from the Imperial navy."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S01_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Destroy the Battleships"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S01_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"Use Natasha and the Magnetic Satellite to destroy the Imperial battleships."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S02_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1
	"Assist the Tesla Troopers"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S02_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Some Tesla Troopers are engaged in combat with Imperial forces. Find a way to help them."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S02_BONUSOBJECTIVE_2
	"Rescue the Tesla Troopers"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S02_BONUSOBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"Some Tesla Troopers have been incarcerated by the Imperial Invaders. Find a way to save them."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S02_BONUSOBJECTIVE_3
	"Rescue the Terror Drones"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S02_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Get Natasha to the K-45 Launch Facility"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S02_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Find a way to the satellite launch facility using the forces at your disposal. Natasha must not fall."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S02_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"The Empire is using Krasna-45 as a stage for additional ambushes. Eliminate all traces of Imperial forces here."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S02_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Eliminate the Imperial Ambush Division"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S03_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Destroy the Imperial forces on this island so that we can build our forward base here."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S03_OBJECTIVE_1_TITLE
	"Clear the Island of Enemy Forces"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S03_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"Establish a forward base by constructing a Barracks and a Naval Yard. Prepare for enemy counterattack."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S03_OBJECTIVE_2_TITLE
	"Construct a Barracks and Naval Yard"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S03_OBJECTIVE_3A_DESC
	"The Imperial navy has blockaded the port of Vladivostok. Destroying their docks and defenses should take us closer to victory."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S03_OBJECTIVE_3A_TITLE
	"Destroy the Imperial Scout Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S03_OBJECTIVE_3B_DESC
	"The Empire of the Rising Sun defends this harbor with a light naval force. Destroy all of it."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S03_OBJECTIVE_3B_TITLE
	"Destroy the Imperial Naval Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S03_OBJECTIVE_4_DESC
	"Raze this structure to the ground, and the Empire's grip on the Soviet Union will come loose."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S03_OBJECTIVE_4_TITLE
	"Destroy the Imperial Military Admin"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S03_OBJECTIVE_BONUS_2_DESC
	"Destroying the Imperial Scout Base's power structures should disable their defenses, allowing us to reestablish contact with our trapped Dreadnoughts."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S03_OBJECTIVE_BONUS_2_TITLE
	"Destroy the Generators"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S03_OBJECTIVE_BONUS_3_DESC
	"Each Commander must construct a Sentry Gun and a Flak Cannon to help fend off Imperial assaults."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S03_OBJECTIVE_BONUS_3_TITLE
	"Set Up Base Defenses"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S04_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Destroy the Allied Supply Port"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S04_OBJECTIVE_1_DETAILS
	"A large Allied naval force has somehow appeared in Lake Geneva and is being maintainted at the Supply Port here. Destroy it."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S04_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Destroy the Allied Army Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S04_OBJECTIVE_2_DETAILS
	"The Premier's favored General Krukov is on his way. He cannot safely establish his base until the local Allied Army Base is destroyed."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S04_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Destroy the Allied Command HQ"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S04_OBJECTIVE_3_DETAILS
	"The Allied Command HQ possesses a Chronosphere weapon, source of their naval strike force. Destroy the HQ, and Geneva is ours."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S04_OBJECTIVE_4
	"General Krukov's HQ Must Survive"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S04_OBJECTIVE_4_DETAILS
	"General Krukov is an old friend of the Premier's. He must be protected at all costs, or the Premier would be most disappointed."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S04_OBJECTIVE_5_BONUS
	"Capture All Six Swiss Banks"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S04_OBJECTIVE_5_BONUS_DETAILS
	"Use Combat Engineers to capture the six Swiss Banks for additional income. The Union is always hungry for more resources."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S05_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1
	"Destroy the Tech Inhibitor"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S05_BONUSOBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"This Tech Inhibitor is blocking access to production blueprints. Destroy it to access additional construction options."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S05_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Expand to the Islands"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S05_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Expand to these islands using a Sputnik and claim the Ore Mines on them. You may also expand using an MCV if available."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S05_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Capture the Ore Refineries"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S05_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Destroy the Allied Naval Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S05_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"Eliminate the Allies' military production capability here in Mykonos."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S05_OBJECTIVE_4
	"Capture the Allied Science Facility"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S05_OBJECTIVE_4_DESC
	"This Science Facility is researching new weapons technology, which we require. Capture it using a Combat Engineer."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S05_OBJECTIVE_5_DESC
	"We need time to gather data from the Science Facility. Hold the Facility and prevent the Allies from retaking it."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S05_OBJECTIVE_5_EASY
	"Hold the Science Facility"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S05_OBJECTIVE_5_HARD
	"Hold the Science Facility"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S05_OBJECTIVE_5_MED
	"Hold the Science Facility"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S06_BONUS_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Build an Expansion Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S06_BONUS_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Krukov is entrenched. Build an expansion base and drive him from his lair."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S06_BONUS_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Build an Apocalypse Tank"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S06_BONUS_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"Use your newly available Apocalypse Tank to eliminate Krukov"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S06_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Destroy Both Allied Forward Bases"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S06_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"We must draw the Allies out of hiding. Assault these bases and all shall be revealed."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S06_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Eliminate Krukov"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S06_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"Krukov has been branded a traitor and your orders are to eliminate him at once. Kirov Airships are available to ensure this is done."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S06_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Destroy the Allied Strategic Airbase"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S06_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"The Allies have finally shown their hand in this region. Their strategic airbase must be destroyed completely."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_BONOBJECTIVE_1
	"Destroy the Generators"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_BONOBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Destroy the Generators to bring down the base defenses protecting the Emperor's palace grounds."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_BONOBJECTIVE_2
	"Rescue the Captured Conscript and Bear"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_BONOBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"The Premier will reward the first Commander to rescue these heroes of the Soviet people."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_BONOBJECTIVE_3
	"Destroy the Air Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_OBJECTIVE_1
	"Assassinate the Emperor"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_OBJECTIVE_1_DESC
	"Sneak your way though the castle grounds to find the Emperor. Avoid confrontation. Both the Conscript and the Bear must survive."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_OBJECTIVE_2
	"Create a Diversion"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_OBJECTIVE_2_DESC
	"You must create a diversion to draw the guards away from your path to the Emperor. An explosion should be just the thing."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_OBJECTIVE_3
	"Destroy Shinzo's Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_OBJECTIVE_3_DESC
	"Destroy Commander Shinzo's base to take him out of the fight."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_OBJECTIVE_4
	"Destroy Naomi's Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_OBJECTIVE_4_DESC
	"Destroy Commander Naomi's base to eliminate her from the battle."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_OBJECTIVE_5
	"Destroy Kenji's Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_OBJECTIVE_5_DESC
	"Destroy Commander Kenji's base and to get him out of the picture for good."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_OBJECTIVE_6
	"Destroy the Emperor's Palace"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_OBJECTIVE_6_DESC
	"Destroy the Emperor's Palace to put an end to the Empire of the Rising Sun."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_OBJECTIVE_7
	"Kill the Emperor"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S07_OBJECTIVE_7_DESC
	"The Emperor still lives, piloting a mechanized suit. Your are under orders to kill him."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S08_KILL_EMISSARY
	"Destroy the Allied Emissary and His Escort"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S09_BONOBJ2_DESC
	"Fort Bradley is one of the Allies' last lines of defense. Crush it utterly before moving on to your final objective in New York City."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S09_BONOBJ2_TITLE
	"Destroy Fort Bradley"
End

MISSIONOBJ:S09_OBJ2_DESC
	"This monument to Allied arrogance must be brought down by any means necessary to put the Union's old enemies in their rightful place."
End

MISSIONOBJ:S09_OBJ2_TITLE
	"Destroy the Statue of Liberty"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T02_OBJECTIVE_01
	"Build an Allied Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T02_OBJECTIVE_01_DESC
	"Unpack your MCV by pressing the \"F\" key, then left-clicking on open terrain. Then construct a Power Plant, Ore Refinery, and Boot Camp by clicking on their respective build buttons.\n\nOnce they're ready to be placed, click their buttons again, then click on open terrain.\n\nAfterwards, train some Peacekeepers from your Boot Camp by clicking on their portrait.\n\nFinally, build a Power Plant."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T02_OBJECTIVE_02
	"Unpack a Prospector into a Command Hub"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T02_OBJECTIVE_02_DESC
	"Select your Prospector and left-click its special ability button. Then left-click on open terrain to unpack it. Try unpacking across the water on the small island."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T02_OBJECTIVE_02_DESC_360
	"Select your Prospector, hold the Right Bumper, and press the X button to use its Unpack ability. Then press the A button on open terrain to unpack it. Try unpacking across the water on the small island."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T02_OBJECTIVE_03
	"Build a Soviet Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T02_OBJECTIVE_03_DESC
	"Build a Reactor and a Crusher Crane by clicking on their respective buttons, then clicking on open terrain."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T02_OBJECTIVE_04
	"Build a Rising Sun Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T02_OBJECTIVE_04_DESC
	"Construct a Generator Core by clicking on its button in the Production Structures tab. When the Generator Core emerges from the Construction Yard, select it and left-click on its Unfurl ability button. Then left-click on open terrain."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T02_OBJECTIVE_05
	"Upgrade to Heightened Clearance"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T02_OBJECTIVE_05_DESC
	"Upgrade both your Construction Yard and Command Hub by selecting them and left-clicking on the Heightened Clearance buttons in the Sidebar."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T02_OBJECTIVE_05_DESC_360
	"Upgrade both your Construction Yard and Command Hub by selecting them, opening the Command Menu, and selecting the Heightened Clearance button for each structure."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T03_OBJECTIVE1
	"Learn to Use Special Abilities"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T03_OBJECTIVE1_DESC
	"Try out the special abilities of the Allied Cryocopter, Allied Hydrofoil, and Imperial Mecha Tengu by selecting the unit and pressing its ability button or the \"F\" key."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T03_OBJECTIVE2
	"Learn about Garrisoning"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T03_OBJECTIVE3
	"Learn about Contextual Attacks"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T03_OBJECTIVE3_DESC
	"Use contextual attacks to dispose of the Conscripts (or hide amongst them) by selecting Tanya (or the Spy) and right-clicking on the enemy."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T04_OBJECTIVE1
	"Learn About Selling and Repairing"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T04_OBJECTIVE1_DESC
	"Use the sell and repair commands by clicking on the icons under the radar to sell and repair structures."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T04_OBJECTIVE2
	"Learn to Use Top-Secret Protocols"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T04_OBJECTIVE2_DESC
	"Use the Surveillance Sweep protocol to sweep across a section of the battlefield by selecting the power, then left-clicking on the map at two locations."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T04_OBJECTIVE3
	"Destroy the Enemy Base Using What You Learned"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T04_OBJECTIVE3_DESC
	"Use Top-Secret Protocols and a maxed-out threat meter to destroy the enemy units and structures."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T05_OBJECTIVE1
	"Defend the Base"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T05_OBJECTIVE1_DESC
	"Learn about and use the Reverse-Move command, Control Groups, and Support Structures to defend your base."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T05_OBJECTIVE2
	"Use Advanced Unit Commands"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T05_OBJECTIVE2_DESC
	"Use the Advanced Commands panel, located to the lower-left of the unit portrait."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T05_OBJECTIVE3
	"Survive While Suppressed"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T05_OBJECTIVE3_DESC
	"Attack the garrisoned structure with Javelin Soldiers to see suppression in action."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T06_OBJECTIVE01
	"Issue a Take Position Directive Here"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T06_OBJECTIVE01_DESC
	"To issue a Take Position directive, left-click on the Take Position button in the Co-Commander Monitor. Then left-click on the terrain."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T06_OBJECTIVE02
	"Issue a Strike Target Directive Here"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T06_OBJECTIVE02_DESC
	"To issue a Strike Target directive, left-click on the Strike Target button in the Co-Commander Monitor. Then left-click on an enemy unit or structure."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T06_OBJECTIVE03
	"Issue a Plan Attack Directive Here"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T06_OBJECTIVE03_DESC
	"To issue a Plan Attack directive, left-click on the Plan Attack button in the Co-Commander Monitor. Then left-click on the terrain. You may also left-click on an enemy."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T06_OBJECTIVE04
	"Issue the Keep Command Directive to Your Co-Commander"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T06_OBJECTIVE04_DESC
	"To issue a Keep Command order, left click on the Keep Command button in the Co-Commander Monitor."
End

MISSIONOBJ:T06_OBJECTIVE05
	"Execute the Co-Commander Strike"
End

MISSIONOBJ:T06_OBJECTIVE05_DESC
	"To execute the Co-Commander Strike, left-click on the Co-Commander Strike beacon on the battlefield. Then left-click on the Execute button."
End

MISSIONOBJ:TO3_OBJECTIVE2_DESC
	"Garrison and Evacuate Peacekeepers using the special ability buttons on a civilian structure, Multigunner IFV, and Riptide ACV."
End

MISSIONOBJ:TUTORIAL_OBJECTIVE1
	"Learn Camera Controls"
End

MISSIONOBJ:TUTORIAL_OBJECTIVE1_DESC
	"To pan the camera, hold down the right mouse button and move your mouse around. To rotate the camera, hold down the middle mouse button and move the mouse around. To zoom the camera move your mouse wheel back and forth."
End

MISSIONOBJ:TUTORIAL_OBJECTIVE2
	"Move the Peacekeepers to the Designated Point"
End

MISSIONOBJ:TUTORIAL_OBJECTIVE2_DESC
	"To move your units, select them and right click on open terrain. Move your units to the designated spot up ahead."
End

MISSIONOBJ:TUTORIAL_OBJECTIVE3
	"Defeat the Training Dummies"
End

MISSIONOBJ:TUTORIAL_OBJECTIVE3_DESC
	"To attack an enemy, select your units and right-click on them. Kill all the Conscripts outside the Donut Shop."
End

MISSIONOBJ:TUTORIAL_OBJECTIVE4
	"Defeat the Training Dummies Guarding the Strategic Point"
End

MISSIONOBJ:TUTORIAL_OBJECTIVE4_DESC
	"Try killing the enemy Conscripts and Flak Troopers by issuing an Attack-Move order. To issude an Attack-Move order, select your units, press the A key, then right-click on open terrain near the enemy units."
End

MISSIONOBJ:Y01_OBJECTIVE_01_DESC
	"By seeking out Secret Files, Yuriko will discover her latent Psionic Talents, which may give her the means to escape."
End

MISSIONOBJ:Y01_OBJECTIVE_01_TITLE
	"Access Secret Files to Become Stronger"
End

MISSIONOBJ:Y01_OBJECTIVE_02_DESC
	"Yuriko must fight her way out of the very place that made her what she is."
End

MISSIONOBJ:Y01_OBJECTIVE_02_TITLE
	"Escape From Shiro Psychic Research"
End

MISSIONOBJ:Y03_OBJECTIVE_00_DESC
	"Yuriko refuses to risk leaving any witnesses of her return to Shiro Psychic Research. Besides, only fools would have stayed at this place after the last incident."
End

MISSIONOBJ:Y03_OBJECTIVE_00_TITLE
	"Kill Everyone"
End

MISSIONOBJ:Y03_OBJECTIVE_01_DESC
	"Yuriko must find a working security elevator to reach Dr. Shimada down in the lower level."
End

MISSIONOBJ:Y03_OBJECTIVE_01_TITLE
	"Gain Access to the Lower Level"
End

MISSIONOBJ:Y03_OBJECTIVE_02_DESC
	"The man who turned Yuriko into a monster is the natural target of all her wrath. Knowing this, he set up a complex network of defenses to stop her."
End

MISSIONOBJ:Y03_OBJECTIVE_02_TITLE
	"Kill Dr. Shimada"
End

MISSIONOBJ:Y03_OBJECTIVE_03_DESC
	"Yuriko must do everything in her power to send the manipulative Izumi to the same place she recently sent Dr. Shimada."
End

MISSIONOBJ:Y03_OBJECTIVE_03_TITLE
	"Kill Izumi"
End

