MOVIE:A01MM01_DESC
	"General Krukov introduces himself to the Commander."
End

MOVIE:A01MM01_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 1: Intermission"
End

MOVIE:A03MM01_DESC
	"The Commander has liberated Western Europe from the Soviets."
End

MOVIE:A03MM01_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 3: Intermission"
End

MOVIE:A06MM01_DESC
	"President Ackerman reveals his rogue plan."
End

MOVIE:A06MM01_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 6: Intermission"
End

MOVIE:AFS01_DESC
	"Lieutenant Eva explains that the Empire of the Rising Sun's provincial shoguns need to be put down, and introduces an unlikely ally."
End

MOVIE:AFS01_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 1: Shin Iga Prefecture"
End

MOVIE:AFS02_DESC
	"Eva reveals the location of another Rising Sun shogun who threatens the Allies' postwar plans, while Prince Tatsu provides additional direction."
End

MOVIE:AFS02_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 2: Osaka"
End

MOVIE:AFS03_DESC
	"Eva implores the Commander to take on one last Imperial shogun who stands in the way of peace. Tatsu asks for no restraint to be used in this final attack."
End

MOVIE:AFS03_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 3: Miyako"
End

MOVIE:AFS04_DESC
	"Eva congratulates the Commander for putting a stop to the Imperial uprising."
End

MOVIE:AFS04_NAME
	"Allies Mini-Campaign Conclusion"
End

MOVIE:AFS05_DESC
	"The Empire's floating island fortress in the North Sea must now be taken down."
End

MOVIE:AFS05_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 5: North Sea"
End

MOVIE:AFS06_DESC
	"President Ackerman takes matters into his own hands and threatens the alliance with the Soviets. He must be stopped."
End

MOVIE:AFS06_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 6: Mt. Rushmore"
End

MOVIE:AFS07_DESC
	"The Empire's Shogunate are assembling in Tokyo. Now is the time to strike."
End

MOVIE:AFS07_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 7: Tokyo Harbor"
End

MOVIE:AFS08_DESC
	"The Soviet Dr. Zelinsky defects and exposes the Soviet's secret base in Cuba."
End

MOVIE:AFS08_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 8: Havana"
End

MOVIE:AFS09_DESC
	"At last, it is time to overthrow the Soviet leaders holed up in Leningrad."
End

MOVIE:AFS09_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 9: Leningrad"
End

MOVIE:AFS10_DESC
	"Thanks to the Commander's efforts, the Soviet leaders are brought to justice."
End

MOVIE:AFS10_NAME
	"Allies Campaign Epilogue"
End

MOVIE:CHWINFS_DESC
	"The sore losers of the Commander's Challenge join forces one last time to offer the victorious Commander a few parting remarks."
End

MOVIE:CHWINFS_NAME
	"Commander's Challenge Bonus Ending"
End

MOVIE:FFS01_DESC
	"FutureTech's head of corporate communications, Kelly Weaver, presents the Commander with a compelling opportunity."
End

MOVIE:FFS01_NAME
	"Commander's Challenge Intro"
End

MOVIE:FFS02_DESC
	"On behalf of FutureTech's shareholders, Ms. Weaver expresses her gratitude to the Commander for weathering so many tough challenges."
End

MOVIE:FFS02_NAME
	"Commander's Challenge Conclusion"
End

MOVIE:J03MM01_DESC
	"The Shogun Executioner is born."
End

MOVIE:J03MM01_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 3: Intermission"
End

MOVIE:JFS01_DESC
	"Prince Tatsu asks the Commander to aid in the defense of the Empire of the Rising Sun, whose borders are being threatened by Soviet forces."
End

MOVIE:JFS01_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 1: Sakhalin Island"
End

MOVIE:JFS02_DESC
	"Tatsu reveals that the Soviets have diverted their forces to move against Oki Island, which is sacred to the Empire, and asks the Commander to stop them."
End

MOVIE:JFS02_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 2: Oki Island"
End

MOVIE:JFS03_DESC
	"Tatsu plots a strike against the Soviet port at Vladivostok, to exact revenge against those responsible for the recent attacks against the Empire."
End

MOVIE:JFS03_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 3: Vladivostok"
End

MOVIE:JFS04_DESC
	"Tatsu graciously thanks the Commander for defeating the Soviet forces and taking the Empire one step closer to its destiny."
End

MOVIE:JFS04_NAME
	"Rising Sun Mini-Campaign Conclusion"
End

MOVIE:JFS05_DESC
	"The Allies have a second attack force making their way to the Japan mainland. They must be stopped."
End

MOVIE:JFS05_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 5: Pacific Ocean"
End

MOVIE:JFS06_DESC
	"The Emperor wants to take control of Los Angeles, the media hub of the West."
End

MOVIE:JFS06_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 6: Santa Monica"
End

MOVIE:JFS07_DESC
	"The Emperor and Tatsu discover an unexpected truth concerning their destiny."
End

MOVIE:JFS07_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 7: Yokohama Harbor"
End

MOVIE:JFS08_DESC
	"Prince Tatsu sends the Commander to Moscow to destroy the device that endangers the Empire."
End

MOVIE:JFS08_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 8: Moscow"
End

MOVIE:JFS09_DESC
	"Prince Tatsu and the Emperor find common ground amid the defeat of the Soviet Union. Now it's time for the final attack against their enemies."
End

MOVIE:JFS09_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 9: Amsterdam"
End

MOVIE:JFS10_DESC
	"The Empire of the Rising Sun is victorious. The Commander is given a special honor."
End

MOVIE:JFS10_NAME
	"Rising Sun Campaign Epilogue"
End

MOVIE:RECAPFS_DESC
	"A brief history of how the Allies managed to end an explosive world war, which led to the events of Red Alert 3: Uprising."
End

MOVIE:RECAPFS_NAME
	"Red Alert 3 Recap"
End

MOVIE:S08MM01_DESC
	"Premier Cherdenko reveals his alternative plans for the Commander."
End

MOVIE:S08MM01_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 8: Intermission"
End

MOVIE:SFS00A_DESC
	"The leaders of the Soviet Union resort to a desperate plan to save themselves from imminent doom."
End

MOVIE:SFS00A_NAME
	"Red Alert 3 Prologue"
End

MOVIE:SFS00B_DESC
	"The Empire of the Rising Sun begins its overwhelming and unexpected assault on the Soviet Union."
End

MOVIE:SFS00B_NAME
	"Red Alert 3 Prologue: The Invasion"
End

MOVIE:SFS01_DESC
	"European Union President Thornley declares that all is well in the recently-demilitarized Soviet Union, even as Soviet resistance forces, led by Information Officer Dasha, plan a rescue mission."
End

MOVIE:SFS01_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 1: Romania"
End

MOVIE:SFS02_DESC
	"The Allies enter into a lucrative agreement with a technology firm called FutureTech, while Dasha reveals that the very same firm has established a facility on Soviet soil."
End

MOVIE:SFS02_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 2: Murmansk"
End

MOVIE:SFS03_DESC
	"Thornley avoids questions about FutureTech's true intentions as Dasha organizes an offensive against a larger FutureTech compound traced to the Yucatan."
End

MOVIE:SFS03_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 3: Yucatan"
End

MOVIE:SFS04_DESC
	"FutureTech is said to be in final preparations to activate a massive structure called the Sigma Harmonizer, but Dasha and the Soviet resistance have contrary plans."
End

MOVIE:SFS04_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 4: Sigma Island"
End

MOVIE:SFS05_DESC
	"FutureTech's spokesperson publicly apologizes for the firm's recent gaffes while Dasha praises the Commander of the Soviet resistance forces for securing the Union."
End

MOVIE:SFS05_NAME
	"Soviets Mini-Campaign Conclusion"
End

MOVIE:SFS06_DESC
	"The Premier, having survived an attempt on his life, orders the Commander to assault the Allies' strategic airbase in Iceland. This is their last foothold in Europe."
End

MOVIE:SFS06_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 6: Iceland"
End

MOVIE:SFS07_DESC
	"The Premier assigns the newly-promoted Commander with a bold mission to eliminate the Emperor of Japan at his palace in the heart of the country."
End

MOVIE:SFS07_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 7: Mt. Fuji"
End

MOVIE:SFS08_DESC
	"The Premier sets up a trap for the Allies in the form of a false peace treaty."
End

MOVIE:SFS08_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 8: Easter Island"
End

MOVIE:SFS09_DESC
	"The Premier's seat of power has been vacated, leaving but one task remaining: The final defeat of the Americans, led by their President Ackerman."
End

MOVIE:SFS09_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 9: New York City"
End

MOVIE:SFS10_DESC
	"The Commander has finally triumphed over the Soviet Union's mortal enemies and earned the distinguished title of Premier."
End

MOVIE:SFS10_NAME
	"Soviets Campaign Epilogue"
End

MOVIE:YFS01_DESC
	"A special report concerning Yuriko Omega reveals some of her origins from before she became the Empire of the Rising Sun's infamous psionic commando."
End

MOVIE:YFS01_NAME
	"Yuriko Chapter 1: Shiro Psychic Research"
End

MOVIE:YFS02_DESC
	"The report on Yuriko Omega continues to describe her detainment in an Allied prison camp, following the defeat of the Empire."
End

MOVIE:YFS02_NAME
	"Yuriko Chapter 2: Detention Camp Dakota"
End

MOVIE:YFS03_DESC
	"The report on Yuriko concludes with speculative remarks about Yuriko's escape and future plans."
End

MOVIE:YFS03_NAME
	"Yuriko Chapter 3: Shiro Psychic Research (Renovated)"
End

MOVIE:YFS04_DESC
	"Having buried the ghosts of her past, Yuriko's mind is finally at ease, if only for a fleeting moment."
End

MOVIE:YFS04_NAME
	"Yuriko Mini-Campaign Conclusion"
End

MSG:TEST2
	"And everywhere that Mary when, the lamb was sure to go."
End

MSG:TESTING
	"Mary had a little lamb, its fleece as white as snow."
End

