OBJDESC:CAPTURE_VIP_BUNKERS
	"Send Engineers into the Soviet V.I.P. Bunkers to transfer all Soviet structures in the area to your control. Force their obedience!"
End

OBJDESC:DESTROY_TIME_MACHINE
	"Hurry and destroy the Kremlin and the Time Machine before the Premier escapes with it!"
End

OBJDESC:J02_BONUS_STATUES
	"The Emperor expects for all Soviet cultural monuments to be brought down, in order to break the spirits of the Soviet people."
End

OBJDESC:J02_ESTABLISH_BEACHEAD
	"Escort the Imperial construction vehicles to the staging area, then assemble a military base with which to lay claim to this land."
End

OBJDESC:J02_KILL_STATUE
	"The Mother Russia Statue is one of the Union's most famous landmarks, symbolizing the Soviets' assumed military might and prosperity. Topple it to the ground."
End

OBJDESC:J02_TRANSPORTS
	"Cargo transports bearing secret equipment will arrive via the river to the east and travel westward. Ensure their survival."
End

OBJDESC:J03_ARTILLERY
	"Use the mighty Shogun Executioner to crush the Soviet Artillery Batteries."
End

OBJDESC:J03_BONUS_CULTURE_KILLER
	"Demoralize the Soviet troops even further by destroying their beloved landmarks here."
End

OBJDESC:J03_DESTROY_KRUKOV
	"General Krukov is attacking you from one of the northern bases.  Destroy them both, just to be sure."
End

OBJDESC:J03_ESCORT_PARTS
	"Protect General Tatsu's cargo transports on their route to the assembly area. When all the parts have arrived, the secret weapon will be assembled."
End

OBJDESC:J07_CAPTURE_OUTPOSTS
	"The Allies have besieged several of our forward bases. Use Yuriko Omega and any reinforcements to take them back."
End

OBJDESC:J07_DEFEND_OUTPOSTS
	"Reinforcements are en route. Prevent the Allied forces from overwhelming your outposts, and prepare to fight back."
End

OBJDESC:J07_DESTROY_RELAY_STATIONS
	"The Allies are attempting to use their Relay Stations to shut down our battlefield control. Destroy those stations before our entire military network is taken offline."
End

OBJDESC:J07_DESTROY_SOVIETS
	"The Soviet Union dares to assist the Allies in this insolent attack. Annihilate the Soviet forces and their structures."
End

OBJDESC:J07_SAVE_NANOSWARM
	"Recover our superweapons, which will help cut off the Allies' relay stations and defend against their attacks."
End

OBJDESC:J08_DESTROY_EVERYTHING
	"Destroy the Kremlin and all Soviet bases.  Leave no trace of the Soviets in this area."
End

OBJDESC:J08_MECHAKING_MUST_LIVE
	"The Shogun Executioner must survive this battle."
End

OBJDESC:J08_WAIT_FOR_MECHAKING
	"Crown Prince Tatsu's ultimate war machine is on its way toward the Kremlin, and programmed to destroy it. Prepare for its arrival."
End

OBJDESC:S08_AMBUSH_EMISSARY
	"Build up your forces to ambush the Allied Emissary and his fleet."
End

OBJDESC:S08_CAPTURE_SUPERWEAPON
	"Capture the Premier's powerful superweapon and use it against him!"
End

OBJDESC:S08_DEFEAT_ALLIED_FORCES
	"The ambush was a success!  Drive off the vengeful Allied forces."
End

OBJDESC:S08_DEFEAT_THE_PREMIERE
	"The Premier has gone mad and intends to destroy you. Resist his forces, and fight your way to his Easter Island volcano fortress and raze it to the ground."
End

OBJDESC:S08_DESTROY_SUPERWEAPON
	"Reports indicate the Premier's Vacuum Imploder weapon is preparing to fire. Destroy it before it has a chance to go off!"
End

OBJDESC:S08_KILL_EMISSARY
	"The Allies swam straight into the Premier's trap. Eliminate their emissary and all his cohorts."
End

