SUBTITLE:
	""
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_01
	"[2.5:1.5]Welcome back, Commander.[4.4:1.8]You're looking very fit and rested.[6.7:3.2]I hope you're ready, because we have some important work ahead of us.[10.5:3.9]Our occupation force in Japan has intercepted some disturbing news.[14.9:2.7]Instability is mounting  in various provinces there,[17.9:2.8]threatening everything that we achieved in our victory.[21.2:3.9]Their leader, Tatsu, has been cooperative with our postwar arrangements,[25.4:2.5]but the problem lies with their provincial Shoguns."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_02
	"[28.5:4.2]These warlords are raising armies against Tatsu, and our occupation.[33.2:2.8]The plot seems to be spearheaded by Shinzo Nagama.[36.5:4.6]His loyalties lie fiercely with the late Emperor, and he refuses to bow to any other.[41.5:3.4]We'll need to send in our own forces to put this uprising to rest.[45.3:2.5]You'll be working directly with Tatsu on this.[48.3:1.9]Please try to show him the proper respect, sir,[50.2:2.4]as he's working with us now.[52.6:1.4]Good luck, commander."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_03
	"[57.6:4.7]Commander, I'm told that you're the best field officer the Allies have.[62.6:3.1]I hope so, because we need to move quickly.[66.1:4.3]Shinzo has many loyal followers and his numbers are growing steadily.[70.8:3.5]He has always resented my authority and my progressive ways.[74.8:4.1]He's too old and stubborn to understand that the world has changed.[79.4:2.5]But that doesn't mean he isn't dangerous.[82.6:4.2]He is a master warrior and quite deadly.[87.6:3.3]You'll find him in the Iga Province, home of the Nagama clan.[91.5:4.9]Do not let his stubbornness be the cause of our destruction."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_01
	"[4.4:2.4]You haven't lost your touch, Commander.[7.3:4.9]Shinzo's armies have sworn allegiance to Tatsu, so now that area is secured.[12.5:4.2]However, there are still other Shogunate leaders who are yet unwilling to back down.[17.4:5.3]Despite Shinzo's defeat, The Warlord Kenji in Osaka continues to marshal his forces.[23.1:2.6]Tatsu will give you the particulars on your assignment.[26.3:2]Do be careful, sir."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_02
	"[31.6:5.2]Kenji has always been arrogant, but I never thought he would go this far and betray me.[37.6:2.5]He might prove to be even a greater challenge than Shinzo,[40.6:3.4]as he is a man who has embraced the modern ways of warfare.[44.5:2.8]He will use the latest technology to protect his position.[47.8:3.3]It's a heavily defended high-tech fortress outside of Osaka.[51.9:2.3]Do not under-estimate him.[54.3:5.5]Kenji may seem brash and arrogant, but make no mistake, he is lethal."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_01
	"[4.1:1.7]Good job, Commander.[6.3:4.4]Thanks to your brilliance on the battlefield, the rebellion is very close to being contained.[11.1:3]There is only one Shogun left who is left to surrender.[14.3:3.2]Takara is planning a full scale assault upon the throne.[17.7:1.6]She needs to be stopped, sir.[19.6:3.6]I know your men are tired and your equipment has been pushed to the limit.[23.4:3.6]But this is our last chance to prevent this region from falling into chaos.[27.3:2.3]Tatsu will brief you on the specifics.[30:1]Good luck."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_02
	"[35.4:1]Commander.[37.1:4.8]Takara inspires great loyalty in her men, but she cares nothing for the Empire.[42.2:2.3]She has already turned her people against me.[44.8:5.2]If we let this corruption spread, everything that my father stood for will crumble.[50.5:2.4]Her samurai will die to protect her.[53.4:2]Let them have that honor.[55.8:2.1]Show no mercy, Commander.[58.7:1]Kill them all."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_01
	"[2.2:1.9]I'm glad to see you in one piece, sir.[4.5:2]Tatsu caught us completely off guard.[7:2]We should have suspected he was up to something.[9.3:4.2]If he had succeeded, he could have resurrected the Empire's full military might.[13.8:2.9]The only reason he didn't was because of your efforts.[17.2:1.5]The world owes you a great debt.[19.4:1.2]Thank you, Commander."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH01EV01
	"[1.1:2.2]That's a lot of fire power in your hands, sir.[3.9:4.6]FutureTech calls it the Harbinger Gunship and there's nothing better for bombarding an area.[9:4.2]If you need to clear enemies out of your path, it should do the job."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH01EV02
	"[0.8:2.4]Top notch, Commander, top notch.[3.6:2.7] I'm sure that's one you won't soon forget."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH01SZ01
	"[1.5:1.6]What is this?![3.1:4.1]These lands have been under my ancestors' protection for a thousand years.[7.5:3.1]And now you challenge that legacy?"
End

SUBTITLE:ATH01SZ02
	"[1.7:1.8]What is this trickery?[3.9:4]Your dishonor yourself by using such sorcery."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH01SZ03
	"[2.2:1.9]Your dishonor knows no bounds![4.5:3.5]You capture me with tricks and magic?!"
End

SUBTITLE:ATH01TS01
	"[1.2:1.8]We must capture Shinzo’s Dojo.[3.3:1.9]Use my Imperial Engineers.[5.6:3.1]Then I can send you some additional forces."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH01TS02
	"[0.9:2.2]Today, you have taken on a true warrior.[3.6:7]While I mourn his defeat, I can rest knowing Japan is one step closer to peace and stability."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH02EV01
	"[1.4:1.9]It looks like Kenji knew you were coming.[3.6:2] He's set up quite the defensive perimeter.[6.1:4.6]You'll need to breach this perimeter before focusing attacks on his main base."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH02EV02
	"[1.4:2.1]We have a new addition to the Allied arsenal...[3.8:1.4] the Cryo-Legionnaire.[5.6:3.2] They should help take out those packs of enemies, Commander."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH02KJ01
	"[1.7:2.7]Do you really believe you can get past my defenses?[4.8:1.1] Very bold...[6.3:2.1]but very foolish."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH02KJ02
	"[1.6:0.7]What?[2.7:1.9]You couldn’t have penetrated my Nanoshield…[5.1:1.7]could you?"
End

SUBTITLE:ATH02KJ03
	"[1.7:1.1]Well done.[3.3:1.6]Now I'll actually have to try.[5.5:2.8]Get ready for a beating you'll never forget."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH02KJ04
	"[1.8:1.3]Did you think you’ve won?[3.5:3.6]You don’t even understand what you’ve done, do you?"
End

SUBTITLE:ATH02KJ05
	"[1.6:0.9]Tatsu![2.6:2.4]How can you do this to me!?"
End

SUBTITLE:ATH02KJ06
	"[2.2:1.8]You knew this was going to happen.[4.6:3.3]Now go back to where ever you came from."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH02TS01
	"[2:3.4]Kenji puts his faith in the latest weapons and defense technology.[6:3.4]His fortress is protected by a series of Nanoswarm Hive generators.[10.1:3.8]You’ll have to find a way to infiltrate and destroy them."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH02TS02
	"[1:3.4]You can weaken Kenji by capturing some of his production buildings."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH02TS03
	"[1:3]You can weaken Kenji by capturing some of his production buildings.[4.4:4.1]I’m sending you some of my engineers to assist in the task."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH02TS04
	"[1.2:5.3]If you can repair the downed bridges in the area, I can send you some assistance."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH03EV01
	"[1.1:2]We have a new weapon to help you out, sir.[3.4:3.4] It's called the Pacifier, but don't let the name fool you.[7:3.8]  It will rain serious firepower down on enemy positions."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH03EV02
	"[1.7:1.1]I'm sorry, Commander.[3.2:2.6]We should have had better intel on what Tatsu was up to.[6.5:1.6]Once again you're in the thick of it.[8.5:3.7] You're going to have to stop him before this situation gets out of hand."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH03TK01
	"[1.1:1.3]You better move fast.[2.7:1.8]I'm not waiting for anybody."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH03TS01
	"[1.4:1.8]This land is controlled by Takara.[3.7:2.3]She is young, but she has fought many battles.[6.4:4.4]She  has likely heard about the defeat of Shinzo and Kenji, so be on your guard.[11.2:2.5]She may have laid traps for you."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH03TS02
	"[1.4:3.3]To the southeast lies a communications tower that can aid in this battle.[5:3.8]Capture it and I can send more reinforcements."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH03TS03
	"[1.3:2.1]The Empire is in your debt, Commander.[3.8:4.1]For you have finally cleared the way for the crowning of a new Emperor.[8.5:1.4]Emperor Tatsu.[10.6:5.4]Now I will use the forces you captured from these warlords and expel you and the rest of the Allies from Japan.[16.3:4.9]Once again, we will be the true empire of destiny!"
End

SUBTITLE:ATH03TS04
	"[1.4:3.1]I’ve taken the liberty of comandeering your Chronosphere.[4.9:3.7]It will be of great use to me."
End

SUBTITLE:ATH03TS05
	"[1.6:2.1]No! My father’s legacy![4:1.4]Japan’s destiny![6.2:2.4]Everything was in place!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH01HI01
	"[1.2:1]Well what do we have here?[2.7:2.6]Looks to me like a trainee who could use a few pointers.[6:4.3]I'm Commander Hill, and I'm gonna teach you all about defeat."
End

SUBTITLE:CH01HI02
	"[1.3:1.9]You've got a few good moves for a little whelp.[3.7:1.4] I'll give you that."
End

SUBTITLE:CH02INTRO
	"[1:1.8]You have no place here, Gaijin.[3.5:4.1] This dispute is between Kenji and myself. Do not come between us.[8:2.6] Yes, if you knew what's best for you, you'd just stay out of the way.[11:2.1] Go ahead. Run along."
End

SUBTITLE:CH02KJ02
	"[1.3:1.7]You didn't -win-.[3:2.2]Shinzo weakened me before you even showed up.[5.5:2.6]Next time it will be different."
End

SUBTITLE:CH02SZ02
	"[0.5:2.4]You have disturbed the order of this battle![2.9:1.7]Did I not warn you?[5:2.6]Now you must be punished."
End

SUBTITLE:CH02SZ03
	"[1.1:1.9]Kenji knows no discipline![3.8:3.1]This is why we lost this day."
End

SUBTITLE:CH03HI02
	"[1.3:2.4]I knew you were all going to have to gang up on me."
End

SUBTITLE:CH03INTRO
	"[1.2:3.4]The Oil Derricks in this region belong to the Soviet Union.[5:1.8]All of you, leave.[8.1:1.3] Sorry, sweetheart.[9.7:3.9] When this is over, I'm taking this oil straight back the Land of the Free.[14.1:2.3] Could you two take your squabble elsewhere?[16.8:2.9]I'm claiming this oil for the Empire."
End

SUBTITLE:CH03KJ02
	"[1:1.2]Beaten by a woman,[2.6:1.2] an old man,[4.1:1.5] and -you-?[6:2.1]Ugh..."
End

SUBTITLE:CH03VE02
	"[1:2.5]The Soviet Union will not forget this.[3.8:2.6]You will all pay for what you have done here."
End

SUBTITLE:CH04TK01
	"[1.2:1.9]Welcome to my island fortress![3.4:1.6]Just come over and visit anytime.[5.1:2.1]Oh, and, don't mind the deck guns.[7.1:2.2]They're harmless."
End

SUBTITLE:CH04TK02
	"[0.8:2.6]I thought you were going to be a little easier."
End

SUBTITLE:CH05KJ01
	"[1.4:1.9]I will be coming for you, Commander.[3.7:4]No walls can stand in the way of my King Onis."
End

SUBTITLE:CH05KJ02
	"[1.1:0.8]It is time.[2.4:5.4]Maybe you should call your mother and tell her you won't be home for dinner."
End

SUBTITLE:CH05KJ03
	"[1.1:1.4]The King Onis failed me.[2.8:2.6]They should have destroyed you!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH06INTRO
	"[1:2.2]Well, look at who's dropped by.[3.6:3.2]I know why you're here, you want my Dreadnoughts, eh?[7.3:2.8]I don't blame you. They're quite powerful.[11:2.6] And as you should know, Commander...[13.9:3.9]...a little -too- powerful for someone of your stature."
End

SUBTITLE:CH06KJ02
	"[1.2:0.5]Hmph![2.2:1.5]You can have the Dreadnoughts.[4:3.1]You won't know how to use them anyway."
End

SUBTITLE:CH06MV02
	"[1.8:1.6]My precious Dreadnoughts...[3.8:2.5]...in the hands of a traitor?!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH07VE01
	"[1.5:2.5]Welcome to our orbital re-entry area.[4.2:4.6]You don't mind if we dump some our trash in your backyard, do you?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH07VE02
	"[1.4:3.9]I should have guessed that being showered by garbage wouldn't bother you."
End

SUBTITLE:CH08HI01
	"[0.7:2.2]I wrote the book on tank tactics, boy.[3.4:4.3]Pay attention, cause you're about to learn what it takes to be a -real- commander."
End

SUBTITLE:CH08HI02
	"[1.3:1.7]Well I'll be darned.[3.3:3.2]One day you might actually make something of yourself."
End

SUBTITLE:CH09LY01
	"[1.2:2.7]I don't think we've properly met. I'm Lydia.[4.4:4.5]It's only fair that I mention to you that this island is limited on resources for the two of us.[9.4:3.4]Hence one of us will have to go."
End

SUBTITLE:CH09LY02
	"[1.7:1.7]Running low on funds are we?[3.8:3.3]Didn't your mother ever teach you how to save?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH09LY03
	"[1.4:1.6]You're brighter than you look, Commander.[3.7:2.1]It's your win."
End

SUBTITLE:CH10INTRO
	"[1.1:3.1]Ladies, if you don't mind, this is my island.[4.7:2.1]And I don't remember seeing any of you on the guest list.[7.2:0.9]You can leave now.[8.7:2.1] Oh, so sorry. I can't really do that.[11.9:2]Is that uniform military issue?[14.4:3.7] Hey, librarian.  Don't you have some books to look after?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH10LY02
	"[1:3.5]Perhaps we should have kept a closer eye on you."
End

SUBTITLE:CH10TK02
	"[0.9:2.3]Aw! Somebody couldn't handle it.[3.4:1.1]Well I'm still here.[4.8:2.5]Who's ready for another round?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH10TK03
	"[1.1:1.3]I don't mind getting taken out.[2.4:3.5]As long you make sure they get theirs."
End

SUBTITLE:CH10VE02
	"[1:2.8]Dasvidanya honey."
End

SUBTITLE:CH10VE03
	"[1.1:3.9]I can't believe I got taken out by some prissies."
End

SUBTITLE:CH11GI01
	"[1.1:2]Hm, I haven't seen you before.[3.5:1.1]Well if you know what's good for you,[4.5:2.6] you'd turn around and leave the same way you came in."
End

SUBTITLE:CH11GI02
	"[2:2.8]My spies are everywhere, mate.[5.6:2.8] Take a good look around."
End

SUBTITLE:CH11GI03
	"[1.7:4.4]All it takes to turn your troops into traitors is a little bit of pocket change."
End

SUBTITLE:CH11GI04
	"[1.8:3.1]Well, um, this is rather embarrassing…[5.4:1.1] isn't it.[6.8:2.7] Don't think this is the last you've seen of me."
End

SUBTITLE:CH12INTRO
	"[1:2.9]Be wary of your surroundings, Commander.[4.4:3.4]Your defeat may come quietly and swiftly.[8.4:2.8] My Shinobi are already scouting out your base.[11.8:3.7]I hope a little infiltration doesn't bother you.[16.5:3.9] … and do feed my Terror Drones when they arrive, won't you?[20.7:1.8]They are such hungry little beasts.[22.8:1.8] Heh heh heh."
End

SUBTITLE:CH12KJ02
	"[1.2:2.6]What can I say, my allies failed me.[4.8:3.2]Next time, let's just make it you and me."
End

SUBTITLE:CH12MV02
	"[1.8:1.1]I see what you did.[3.5:1.6]That was quite clever.[5.6:3]But don't expect it happen like that next time."
End

SUBTITLE:CH12SZ02
	"[0.9:2.7]My Shinobi must have betrayed me![4:2.4]This is the only explanation."
End

SUBTITLE:CH13SZ01
	"[1.4:2.9]The Sea-Wing is a thing of great beauty.[4.7:1.8]It can swim, it can fly[6.8:2.5]It kills both ground and sky.[9.6:1.8]Heh heh heh…"
End

SUBTITLE:CH13SZ02
	"[1.2:2.2]I have seen the error in my ways.[3.6:4.9]And for that, I show you my gratitude."
End

SUBTITLE:CH14GI02
	"[1.4:2.3]I thought you were gonna go after -her-!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH14INTRO
	"[1.1:4.8]Well Commander, looks like you're caught between me and that Russian hag on the other side of your base.[6.4:4.8]I tell you what, if you focus on keeping her away from me, I'll go easy on you.[12.9:2]Go ahead. I'm right here.[15.4:6]And when I am finished with you, Commander, I'll take out that English rat hiding behind you."
End

SUBTITLE:CH14VE02
	"[1.6:2]I should have allied with that English swine.[4.6:1.8]Maybe next time we will."
End

SUBTITLE:CH15MV01
	"[1.1:4.1]Your little base here is surrounded in every direction by my forces.[5.5:2.7]So, if you try to leave your base, I will destroy you.[8.5:2.9]And if you try to hide in your base, I will destroy you.[12:1.7]Which will you choose?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH15MV02
	"[1.2:2.6]I let you slaughter my forces on purpose.[4:1.6]Because as you were doing that,[6:2.1]I was studying your simple tactics.[8.6:1.3]Next time we meet,[10.7:2.7]it will be -playtime-."
End

SUBTITLE:CH16INTRO
	"[0.9:3.6]This island has belonged to my ancestors for many years.[5.2:2.6]None of you shall dishonor my family with your presence.[8.6:2.7]Old man! I go where I please…[12:3.9]...and I think this place is going to make a nice summer palace for me.[16.5:4.3]Sorry boys, but -I've- already reserved this place for my summer party.[21.3:2.5]Now if you don't mind…?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH16KJ02
	"[1.2:1.3]I've changed my mind.[3:3.2]This place reeks of an outsider's filth."
End

SUBTITLE:CH16SZ02
	"[1.1:3.4]How dare you show such disrepect to your elders![4.8:1.6]All of you!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH16TK02
	"[0.8:1.6]Great. Thanks a lot.[2.5:3.3]Now I'll have to change all my plans."
End

SUBTITLE:CH17INTRO
	"[1.1:1.8]Kenji and I have made amends.[3.4:4.8]Now you must prove yourself and defeat him before I raise my sword.[9.3:6.2] But since this barbarian won't get through me, you won't have to worry about that, Shinzo."
End

SUBTITLE:CH17KJ02
	"[2:0.9]What?[2.9:5.1]I was going easy on you so the old man wouldn't fall asleep."
End

SUBTITLE:CH17SZ02
	"[1.1:2.1]You may have taught the young one a lesson.[3.7:3.3]Now it is time for me to teach you."
End

SUBTITLE:CH17SZ03
	"[2:3.3]...I have disgraced the Nagama family..."
End

SUBTITLE:CH18INTRO
	"[1.3:0.8]What?[2.5:2.3]That robotic monstrosity is back?![5.6:3.3]Well, at least this time it won't just be going after me![9.5:2.3] That thing better not get near my base.[12.5:2.2]You guys won't mind distracting it for me will you?[15.4:2.5] Hah hah hah hah, good luck!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH18LY02
	"[1.3:1.6]But I had such a good plan.[3.6:3.1]That thing out there spoiled everything."
End

SUBTITLE:CH18MV02
	"[1.3:1.6]The monster is no more![3.6:3.8]But do you have enough strength left to deal with me!?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH18MV03
	"[1.1:1.6]So what.[2.7:2.4]You managed to avoid that thing out there.[5.7:3.7]Next time it will be just you and me."
End

SUBTITLE:CH19TK01
	"[1.2:2.2]Are you going to come out and play in the water with me?[3.4:2.1]It's nice and warm."
End

SUBTITLE:CH19TK02
	"[0.9:3.7]And I thought I was gonna have a nice day at the beach!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH20MV01
	"[1.2:3.1]Ahh, good to see you again, my friend.[4.8:2.5]I'm afraid this will be the last time, however.[7.7:6]For if the desolater strikes don't kill you, my hordes of Terror Drones surely will."
End

SUBTITLE:CH20MV02
	"[2.3:3.1]What have you done to all my little toys?[6.2:2.5]I will not forget this…"
End

SUBTITLE:CH21SZ01
	"[1.1:2.6]Destiny has granted me many years.[4.2:5.8]And now, I will wait here in my base, and decimate you from afar."
End

SUBTITLE:CH21SZ02
	"[1.2:1.2]What are you waiting for?[2.4:3]Do you not see what is coming?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH21SZ03
	"[1.7:2.1]Your courage finally took hold.[4.1:2.6]Well done."
End

SUBTITLE:CH22GI02
	"[0.9:1]What?[1.9:1.6]  This is bloody ridiculous.[3.5:3.3]If that Russian wench would have just held up her end of this…"
End

SUBTITLE:CH22INTRO
	"[1.5:1.4]Back again so soon?[3.6:3.3]Well this time the Englishman and I are taking you down.[7.5:4.3] That's right ol' chap. You aren't getting past the two of us, heh heh.[13.6:1.8]...I'm good."
End

SUBTITLE:CH22VE02
	"[3:3.3]I knew I shouldn't have counted on that blowhard to help."
End

SUBTITLE:CH23LY01
	"[1.5:1.4]You seem like a smart Commander.[3.6:2.7]So why would you want to go up against me?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH23LY02
	"[1.4:0.9]Not bad.[2.7:3.9]A little sloppy with the execution, of course, but it worked."
End

SUBTITLE:CH24TK01
	"[1.1:3.9]So, you've come back to visit me at my new island fortress![5:3]I'll send my little friend Yuriko to welcome you.[8.2:2.8]She might bring a few friends with her."
End

SUBTITLE:CH24TK02
	"[1.3:2]What happened to all my Yuriko clones?![3.3:1.8]I should've won!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH25INTRO
	"[1.5:3.9]You dare challenge the Soviet powers in their own homeland?[5.9:1.4] Hah, hahaha![7.6:1.9] You must be mad,[9.5:2.4]to think you can come here and take all three of us.[11.9:1.3] Heh, hehehe.[13.8:3.1] If you wanted our Kirovs, Commander, you should have just asked.[17.4:3.3]Here, let me send them over to you…"
End

SUBTITLE:CH25MV02
	"[2.2:1.1]I've lost?[3.7:3.6]Not me. Not Moskvin...!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH25OL02
	"[1.5:1.1]What happened?![3.9:3.7]It's a good thing my mother isn't alive to see this one…"
End

SUBTITLE:CH25VE02
	"[1.4:1.9]I don't know how you did it…[3.5:2]...but that was pretty good."
End

SUBTITLE:CH26HI02
	"[1:1.9]You cocky little bastard.[3.5:3.1]Your lack of respect is a disgrace to that uniform."
End

SUBTITLE:CH26INTRO
	"[2:2.2]You might think you have a head start on us.[4.5:4.2]But there's only one of you. Who are you going to go after first?[9.8:3.1] You better move fast. I'm not waiting for anybody.[13.8:1.3] What's the matter there, son?[15.7:2.4]A little too much pressure at the startin' gate?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH26OL02
	"[0.9:0.4]Hey,[1.4:1.9]what was I supposed to do?[3.5:1.6]Those other two were useless!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH26TK02
	"[1.1:1.5]You were pretty quick with that.[2.8:1.8]I'm out."
End

SUBTITLE:CH27OL01
	"[1.2:0.9]So...[2.1:1.9] You've made it this far![4:1.2]Not bad.[5.1:3.3]But this battle will be your final doom.[8.9:1.8]Or, shall we say...[10.7:1.4]Apocalypse...[12.1:3.1]Hah hah hah hah!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH27OL02
	"[3.2:2.5]Let's keep this one between you and me.[6:5]If the people find out about this, I will be sent to the gulag for sure."
End

SUBTITLE:CH28GI01
	"[0.9:2.4]Tick tock, Commander.[3.3:5.2] I've got a Proton Collider with your name on it, and there's not a bloody thing you can do about it."
End

SUBTITLE:CH28GI02
	"[0.8:3.1]Another Proton Collider is nearly online, old chum.[4.6:4.4]What the devil are you going to do, hmm?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH28GI03
	"[1.5:0.8]Hmph![2.3:3.9]Next time I'll bring something even bigger than the Proton Collider."
End

SUBTITLE:CH29KJ01
	"[1.5:1.8]You don't have to leave your little base.[4.1:2.1]Let mine come to yours."
End

SUBTITLE:CH29KJ02
	"[3.2:2.6]Impressive..."
End

SUBTITLE:CH30GI01
	"[1.4:2.1]Turn your eyes to the sky, Commander.[3.5:4.4] I have some very special deliveries coming your way!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH30GI02
	"[1.8:1.9]I admire your fortitude.[4.2:4]You're not one to give up easily are you?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH31GI02
	"[1.7:1.4]What was I supposed to do?[3.5:2.1]All I had were those little men all over the place.[5.9:2.4] A man like me needs his airforce."
End

SUBTITLE:CH31INTRO
	"[1.3:1.8]Today we will fight like samurai.[3.6:2.4]No vehicles, no navy, no aircraft.[6.6:3.1]Just our courage and our katanas.[10.3:2.7] Don't forget our shotguns, and missile launchers.[14.7:2.1]Mano a mano, mate.[18.1:1.6] We have you outnumbered.[20.3:3.8]Maybe you should come back when you're a little better equipped?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH31SZ02
	"[1:1.8]An impressive display.[3.2:3.3]Perhaps you are worthy of the Nanoswarm Hive after all.[7:3.1]Until our paths cross again."
End

SUBTITLE:CH31VE02
	"[1.9:4.8]If I had a few MiGs or tanks, this would have been very different."
End

SUBTITLE:CH32HI01
	"[1.4:3.9]I hope you've been treating your veteran units right, because they're all you got on this one.[5.7:2.6]I know mine are the best of the best."
End

SUBTITLE:CH32HI02
	"[1.2:2.5]Wipe that smirk off your face, private.[4.1:2] This isn't over."
End

SUBTITLE:CH33OL01
	"[1.3:6.7]Do you know what's like to have indestructble tanks ripping through your base like a bull in a china shop?[8.5:1]No?[9.8:3.6]Well let me show you how the Iron Curtain works."
End

SUBTITLE:CH33OL02
	"[3.1:2.1]Time goes by so fast.[6.2:3.6]I will now give you that demonstration that I promised."
End

SUBTITLE:CH33OL03
	"[1.3:1.9]Do not be too proud of yourself.[3.6:3.8]I went easy on you because I thought you looked so pathetic."
End

SUBTITLE:CH34HI01
	"[1.1:1.8]See all those red barrels everywhere?[3.4:1.1]They're filled with candy![4.7:2.7]Go ahead and break 'em open."
End

SUBTITLE:CH34HI02
	"[1.3:0.9]Okay...[2.8:1.7] So maybe I lied about the barrels.[4.7:1.5] You win."
End

SUBTITLE:CH35KJ01
	"[1.4:0.9]I'm impressed.[2.9:2.1]You have done well to get this far.[5.5:4.8]But now it is time for my legions of Steel Ronin to put you to bed."
End

SUBTITLE:CH35KJ02
	"[2.1:1]What have you done?![4.7:2.9]You're cheating, aren't you."
End

SUBTITLE:CH36TK01
	"[1.4:2.8]Last time we met I was too easy on you.[4.1:2.8]This time I've brought the Giga-Fortress with me.[7.4:1.9]What, you don't know what that is?[9.9:2.2]This might be fun."
End

SUBTITLE:CH36TK02
	"[1.5:1.4]I lost again![2.8:2.4]Fine, take the Giga-Fortress.[5.2:1.9]It didn't help me."
End

SUBTITLE:CH37VE01
	"[1.4:3.4]It's just you and me this time, so don't worry.[4.8:2.9]When you lose, I won't tell anyone."
End

SUBTITLE:CH37VE02
	"[1.5:1.1]So you won.[3.1:1.3]What do you want?[4.6:2]A medal?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH38MV01
	"[1.7:2.6]I have a special friend I'd like you to meet![4.7:2.1]It's my Desolator Trooper.[7.2:1.3]He is very good at disposing[8.5:3.4]of any extra infantry you might be tired of."
End

SUBTITLE:CH38MV02
	"[2.4:2.7]You've killed my Desolator Troopers?[6.4:2.5]Now what's left for me?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH39OL01
	"[1.5:2.6]Do you like hamburger, heh heh?[4.6:3.6]Let's see what your tanks look like when they meet my Grinders."
End

SUBTITLE:CH39OL02
	"[0.7:2]Okay, okay, you got me.[2.7:1.9]You don't have to rub it in."
End

SUBTITLE:CH40LY01
	"[1.3:2.4]A lot of men consider me to be a bit cold.[4.4:2.2]Well, you might want to bundle up, Commander.[6.9:3.4]Things will soon be getting very chilly."
End

SUBTITLE:CH40LY02
	"[1.6:0.8]Well played.[2.8:2.1]I commend you on your victory."
End

SUBTITLE:CH41HI01
	"[1.4:2.1]So you're back for some more schooling.[3.8:2.3]I already got you flanked on both sides, son.[6.5:4]Now I'm gonna squeeze you like a grape."
End

SUBTITLE:CH41HI02
	"[1.4:2.6]I can't believe you slipped out of that."
End

SUBTITLE:CH42GI01
	"[1.2:0.7]Oh![2.5:4.1] It's you again. I thought you would have just given up by now. Well, don't worry, old bean.[6.9:2.8] You will once my gunships start flying overhead.[10.2:1.7] Zhooom!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH42GI02
	"[2.5:3.3]I thought for sure those gunships would have finished you off![6.6:2.7] How resilient of you…"
End

SUBTITLE:CH43OL01
	"[2.1:2.9]Are you ready for doomsday, friend?[5.4:4.6]We will build our superweapons quickly and we will see who survives."
End

SUBTITLE:CH43OL02
	"[2:4.2]Well, look at that, my Vacuum Imploder is ready![6.5:2.8]Let me clean up your messy little base with it."
End

SUBTITLE:CH43OL03
	"[1.5:0.9]What?[2.8:1.1]You're still standing?![3.9:2.1]Who helped you?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH44INTRO
	"[1.7:5]My Natasha has been a little busy on this map and left a few husks behind her.[7.1:3.5]If you two are quick, you may get a few free tanks.[12.3:1] My scouts are already there.[13.9:2.2]Don’t get in my way."
End

SUBTITLE:CH44TK02
	"[1.4:1.9]I could have beaten you and her.[3.7:1.5]Let's go again."
End

SUBTITLE:CH44VE02
	"[1.4:2.8]Ha, laugh now. But next time...[4.2:3.3]I'm sending Natasha to take care of you."
End

SUBTITLE:CH45MV01
	"[2.2:4.8]Sorry, Commander, but you're gonna have to make do without your air support on this one.[7.5:1.3]Don't look so shocked.[9.3:2.1]Save it for later."
End

SUBTITLE:CH45MV02
	"[1.5:3.2]I don't know who you are, or who you work for.[4.9:1.6]But I'm going to find out.[6.5:4.9]And when I do, I'm going to beat you down like the dog that you are…[12:2.5]...and I will enjoy it."
End

SUBTITLE:CH46LY01
	"[1.4:2.9]You -do- know how to use the more advanced weaponry, don't you?[5.5:2.1]Well I guess we'll find out."
End

SUBTITLE:CH46LY02
	"[1.5:1.4]That was an interesting challenge.[3.3:2.8]Of course, you clearly had the advantage."
End

SUBTITLE:CH47HI02
	"[1.1:4.2]How about we do this again on a map where I can use more tanks!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH47INTRO
	"[1.2:1.8]Neither of you belong in these waters.[3.5:2.3]Why do you insist on invading my lands?[6.5:1.4] War's not about who's right.[8.2:2.8]It's about who's still standin'!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH47SZ02
	"[1.8:3.4]Can this be the fate destiny has promised me?"
End

SUBTITLE:CH48LY01
	"[1.5:2.3]Good to see you're still in the fighting spirit, Commander.[4.2:5.4]You'll need it, as I've got reinforcements being chronosphered in from every direction."
End

SUBTITLE:CH48LY02
	"[1.5:0.9]Hmm.[2.8:3.2]By my calculations, your victory here should have been...[6.5:2.2]...very improbable!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH49OL01
	"[1.5:2.9]The bears in this land are quite powerful.[4.8:3.5]They will serve well in my army once I take them back to them Motherland.[8.9:2.8]Step aside if you know what's best for you."
End

SUBTITLE:CH49OL02
	"[1.1:1.4]Okay, I'll leave![3:4.8]The bears here smell far too pretty to serve in the great Soviet Union anyway."
End

SUBTITLE:CH50GI02
	"[1.5:0.7]What?[2.2:3.7]You can't just toss me out of the battle just like that!"
End

SUBTITLE:CH50HI02
	"[1.4:1.6]Well I gotta hand it to you son.[3.4:2.7]You've proven yourself to me today."
End

SUBTITLE:CH50INTRO
	"[0.9:1.7]What the hell's wrong with you?[3.2:1.6]Apparently, you need another whoopin'.[5.3:2.1]This time from all three Allied commanders.[8.4:3.8] Of course, you just could give up right now and save us all a lot of time and trouble.[13.1:2.6] Sorry mate. I'm gonna have to concur.[16.2:4.4]You don't have what it takes for this one."
End

SUBTITLE:CH50LY02
	"[2:1.6]So…[4.3:3.8]...You wouldn't happen to be looking for new recruits, would you?"
End

SUBTITLE:CHWINFS
	"[3.5:0.3]What?[3.8:0.4]What?![4.3:0.6]What?!?[4.8:0.9]What happened?![5.8:0.9]What -is- this?![6.7:0.9]Who helped you?![7.6:1.1]My shinobi...[8.7:1.4]must have betrayed me...[10.1:1.3]This is bloody ridiculous![11.4:1.6]You cocky little bastard...[13:0.8]All I had were those...[13.8:1.1]...little men all over the place...[14.9:1.4]Do not be too proud of yourself...[16.3:1.5]You're cheating, aren't you...?[17.8:0.9]I should've won...![18.7:0.9]....[19.6:1.1]You don't have to rub it in...![20.7:0.4]Ahh--[21.2:0.9]Haa, ha ha![22:1.4]So you won...[23.4:1.2]what do you want,[24.7:1.2]a medal?[25.8:2.1](Ah, hell...)"
End

SUBTITLE:FFS01_01
	"[10.8:3.1]Ah, there you are.[15.1:3.7]Battle Control is finally online, and everything is in place.[19.2:3]We've acquired the construction vehicles from the three world powers[22.4:1.8]and they're now ready for your disposal.[24.5:3.6]The postwar situation is so bogged down in border disputes[28:2.2]that no one will even see you coming.[30.7:3.3]We'll be standing by to collect the technology of the wreckage left behind,[34.2:0.9]so that soon,[35.4:3.9]we'll have samples of all their military assets to do with as we please.[39.9:2.1]Or, as you please.[42.4:0.9]Good luck out there.[44.4:3.3]We'll be monitoring your progress with great interest."
End

SUBTITLE:FFS02_01
	"[2.8:1.9]Very Impressive.[5.3:1.5]I have to be honest with you...[7.3:2.7]none of us expected you to actually make it this far.[10.4:4.6]Many of our shareholders assumed the worst after our last CEO's untimely demise.[15.7:3]We humbly ask that you consider the generous offer we've prepared.[19.5:3.2]I will be visiting you this evening to review the terms in private.[23.5:3.4]Until then… imagine the possibilities.[27.2:3.5]Imagine what we can accomplish in the future."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS01_01
	"[3.4:4.8]Ah, Commander. It's good to see that there is still loyalty for my father's legacy.[8.7:4.7]The Allies occupy our lands and believe that our war machine is dormant.[13.9:3.6]But they do not realize how deeply we honor our traditions.[18.2:4.6]As one of the last samurai standing, the Empire needs your sword.[23.5:5.5]The Soviets are taking advantage of our defeat and making a play for Empire territory.[29.7:4.5]Under the very noses of the Allies, they are attacking Sakhalin Island.[34.7:4.3]Commander Kenji is doing his best, but he cannot hold out for much longer.[39.9:3.5]You must come to his aid and beat back the Soviet advance."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS02_01
	"[3.6:1.9]Excellent work, Commander.[5.8:2.3]But the Soviets are still threatening our borders.[8.8:3.5]Now these arrogant gaijin are preparing to take Oki Island[12.3:1.9]so they can turn it into a naval base.[14.4:2.4]Oki is not just any ordinary island.[17:2.7]It's the sacred resting place of my father's remains.[20.4:4.4]The Allies have an occupation force which is supposed to be maintaining order.[25.2:3.3]But the spineless cowards are hoping they can just ignore this threat.[29.1:3.2]So we'll have to take matters into our own hands.[32.4:3.6]Do not let the Soviet barbarians dishonor my father[36:2.4]and desecrate his final resting place."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS03_01
	"[2.4:3.8]Commander, you have honored my family with your victory at Oki Island.[6.6:2.8]But now it is time to take the fight to the aggressors.[9.9:4.6]We must make Moskvin and Oleg regret that they ever stood up against the Rising Sun.[14.9:4.2]Attack Vladivostok and erase every trace of the Soviet presence.[19.6:3.1]Once this is done, the Pacific will be ours[23:3.4]and our control over these waters will be as it was before the war.[26.8:1.9]Bring them to their knees, commander.[29:2.5]Make them pay for their impudence!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS04_01
	"[2.2:1.2]Well done, Commander.[3.8:3.5]Recapturing Vladivostok was an essential part of my plan[7.7:3.2]to bring the Empire back to its full power and glory.[11.3:4.1]The journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step.[16:5.1]Thanks to you, we are one step closer to our ultimate destiny."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH01GI01
	"[1.5:1.1]Good morning, sir.[3:3.1] I'm Director Giles from the Office of Occupational Forces.[6.1:1.9]I know you're in a bit of a tight spot there...[8:2.4] but we can’t help you right now, unfortunately.[11.1:2.2]We're in a bit of a bind ourselves over here.[14.2:1.2]Sorry."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH01KJ01
	"[1.8:1.9]Ah, you're here to help me. Good![4.2:1]We don't have much time.[5.7:3.4]Move into position so you can be transported behind the enemy."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH01KJ02
	"[1.5:1.2]What are you doing?[2.6:2.8]Move out or I’m going to lose my position!"
End

SUBTITLE:JTH01KJ03
	"[1.3:2]I can’t hold out any longer.[3.3:2.4]You need to move out now!"
End

SUBTITLE:JTH01KJ04
	"[2.3:1.8]You follow instructions well.[4.5:3.6]Now head out and capture that Soviet base to the west."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH01OL01
	"[1.8:1.6]Have you seen my new toy?[4.1:1.6]I call it the Grinder...[6.1:1.7] ...because that what it does.[7.8:4.4]Now watch as everything in their path becomes minced metal."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH01OL02
	"[1.1:3.8]I am so sorry to tell you I'm going to have to leave you now.[5.3:3.2]I have other more-pressing matters that require my attention.[8.5:1.8]But do not grow sad.[10.5:2.6]We will meet again."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH02GI01
	"[1.5:1.2]Ahem.[2.8:1.1]Excuse me.[4.2:2.5] It seems we're missing a few vehicles from our base.[6.7:3.2]You wouldn't happen to know anything about that...[10.5:1.3] would you?"
End

SUBTITLE:JTH02MV01
	"[1.8:0.7]What?[2.9:1.4]What is this?[4.3:1.9]You little vermin, eh?[7.2:2.6]I will enjoy shutting you down quickly."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH02MV02
	"[1.9:3.2]You know I'm going crush you with my boot heel soon enough.[5.5:6.3]Please, accept defeat before my anger takes control of me."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH02MV03
	"[1.6:3.6]Just accept that you’ve stepped into a pile of failure.[5.8:2.6]These islands are almost mine."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH02MV04
	"[1.8:1.6]This time, you win.[3.9:2.5]I suggest you do not celebrate quite yet.[6.8:1.5]For, I promise you...[8.6:2.4]...Moskvin will be back."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH02TS01
	"[1.5:2.2]We cannot lose this location to the Soviets.[4.4:3.6]The memory of my father and the honor of our empire depends upon it.[8.6:4.2]The attack is impending, and yet the Allies here are refusing to help us.[13.2:3.3]We're not going to ask again for their help, we're going to take it.[17:5.6]Capture some of the Allied units to help defend the islands until reinforcements arrive."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH02TS02
	"[1.7:1.6]Good job holding your ground.[3.7:2.2]The Soviets still press us, however.[6.2:2.8]Keep the tomb of my father intact."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH03GI01
	"[1.2:2.5]Just a smidge more sugar in the tea would be…[3.9:1.6]Ah!  Ko-nichi-wa, Commander.[6.2:3.9] I’m afraid that you've, once again, broken the conditions of the post-war agreements.[10.6:5.8]And now you, and these Russians, must be put down for this little uprising."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH03GI02
	"[1.6:2.4]As you can plainly see, we've already beaten you.[4.4:5.1]You should save a little dignity for the march back to Tokyo, methinks."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH03GI03
	"[1.5:2.4]Yes, I... Oh, good grief, look at the time.[4.5:3.5] And I was having so much fun. Cheerio then."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH03MV01
	"[3.2:1.6]You again![5.1:1.9]You make me so furious,[7.1:2.5]I want to commit a war crime!"
End

SUBTITLE:JTH03MV02
	"[1.9:1.9]I don't know what happened.[3.8:3.3]Oleg is surely to blame for this."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH03OL01
	"[1.4:1.3]What is this?[3:2.8]You think you can defeat me with such a puny force?[6.7:4.2]This will be easier than my fight with my wife last night."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH03OL02
	"[1.7:2.8]It was Commander Moskvin who let this happen...[5.1:1.1]You win today.[6.6:4.5]But don't think for a second that this means your lands are safe."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH03TS01
	"[1.4:1.5]Time to end the enemy threat.[3.4:2.9]This is the Soviet base responsible for these attacks.[6.7:3.9]Clear the nearby outpost and establish a foothold."
End

SUBTITLE:JTH03TS02
	"[1.5:2.8]I am granting you our newest, most powerful weapon...[4.7:1.4]...the Giga-Fortress.[6.5:3.8]Show no mercy, Commander, for they have shown us none."
End

SUBTITLE:RECAPFS_01
	"[1.9:6.2]After years of conflict, the free nations of the world were finally about to defeat the USSR.[8.7:2.2]To save themselves, the Soviet leaders[11.3:2.3]came up with a desperate plan.[13.8:3.1]They created an experimental time travel device,[17.5:8]and went back into the past to eliminate the one man most responsible for the Allies technological superiority:[25.8:1.6]Albert Einstein."
End

SUBTITLE:RECAPFS_02
	"[28.4:1.8]They forever changed the future.[31:1.5]In this new timeline,[32.9:3.8]the Soviets were the aggressors and the Allies were on the run.[37.9:4.4]But in the process, they inadvertently spawned a third world power:[42.5:3.1]the Empire of the Rising Sun."
End

SUBTITLE:RECAPFS_03
	"[46.9:1.9]Led by the Emperor Yoshiro,[49.5:2.8]they believed that they were destined to conquer the world.[56.9:2]The Empire struck without warning.[64.6:2.5]Luckily, we weren't caught totally unawares.[67.5:2.9]We rallied our troops and marshaled our forces.[71.5:2.7]We proved victorious.[81:3.5](Available now on the PC and Xbox 360)"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_01
	"[1.2:1.7]Well that's a good question.[2.9:1]Thank you.[4.1:3]With the Soviet Union's government dismantled,[7.4:3]we can now share the benefits of the free market[10.6:2.2]with those who have been excluded.[13.2:5.5]The Allied occupation forces are only there to ease this transition.[18.7:3.7]I mean, there has been rumors of a possible resistance,[22.4:4.4]but so far, I'm glad to say, we haven't seen anything of the sort.[27.3:2.8]The Russian people have welcomed us with open arms.[30.1:2.1]They've denounced their former leaders[32.2:3.4]and have embraced liberty and opportunity."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_02
	"[41.6:3.4]Commander, these are dark times, are they not?[45.6:3]We are very grateful that you have joined our cause.[49.1:3.8]The people need leadership if they are to rise against the Allied oppressors.[53.2:4.4]Our resistance movement is well underway, but we have a problem.[58.1:5.4]Our scientists who are instrumental to our new weapons development have mysteriously gone missing.[63.9:4.4] Our scouts have discovered a suspicious research facility protected by Allied forces.[68.7:4.6]We must search there for any clues regarding the whereabouts of our scientists.[73.7:5.2]You'll be granted only a small force.  It is all we can spare.[79.4:2.2]Find out as much as you can, comrade.[82.1:2.4]Udachi!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_01
	"[6.9:3.3]Today,  the world's largest technology firm, FutureTech,[10.2:2.5]again made headlines when hundreds of activists[13:2.4]protested outside their corporate headquarters.[15.4:2]FutureTech spokesperson, Kelly Weaver,[17.4:3.9]responded to the rising public concern over  her firm's  latest project,[21.4:1.9]the  \"Sigma Harmonizer\"."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_02
	"[23.8:3.9]Protestors spoke out against the Chronosphere when that was in development as well.[27.7:4.5]It's normal for there to be some fear and skepticism when it comes to change.[32.1:5.4]But I can assure you that public safety is our number one priority at FutureTech."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_03
	"[39:3.3]More worries were raised when EU President  Rupert Thornley[42.3:3.5]recently approved a trillion dollar contract with FutureTech.[46:4]There's grave public concern regarding the apparent lack of government oversight."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_04
	"[50.5:5.7]FutureTech's advances have improved our lives and brought us unmatched prosperity.[56.2:4.2]I mean, if not for their technology, we wouldn't be where we are today, would we?[60.3:6.3]I mean,  If we can't trust FutureTech, who can we trust?"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_05
	"[74.1:1.4]I can't believe this.[75.8:5.6]FutureTech has full support from the Allies, even though they have been kidnapping our scientists for their own devices.[82.1:2.7]We have located another secret research facility.[85.4:3.9]This time they had the audacity to locate it in Mother Russia herself.[90:3.9]Protect our people and put an end to whatever they are doing there.[94.3:2.5]Dasvedanya."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_01
	"[1.4:2.5]There are reports of an attack on a remote[4:3]FutureTech research facility in Northern Russia.[6.9:5.2]Local citizens apparently had no idea that such a facility was even located there."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_02
	"[12.8:2.8]Mr. President! What sort of research was[15.6:2.8]FutureTech working on in such a remote part of Russia?"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_03
	"[18.5:4.6]Erm, well, first, may I just reassure people,[23.1:4.1]Our first concern right now is finding the terrorists[27.2:2.8]who perpetrated this cowardly attack.[30:3.1]Now, I have full confidence that FutureTech[33.1:3.9]is dedicated to making our world a better place.[37.3:4.4]But, of course their employees, they can't be expected  to build us a better future[41.7:3.3]if they're working in fear of their very lives.[45.3:1.9]Now, excuse me, we're late.[47.3:1]Thank you."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_04
	"[53.9:2.2]It looks like our cold war is heating up.[56.4:4.8]Our agents have traced the source of Thornley's reinforcements from your mission in Siberia.[61.7:4.6]The troops came from a military base located a half a world away in the Yucatan.[66.8:6.4]The Allied command doesn't even know about this base. If they're not about to stop FutureTech, then we will.[73.7:4.7]Whatever this group is building will surely be used to keep the Soviet people under their boot heel.[79.2:5.2]Go to the Yucatan and destroy these forces which are protecting FutureTech."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_01
	"[1.7:5.1]Allied troops have been deployed to protect FutureTech's controversial new Sigma Harmonizer.[7.2:2]It's scheduled to go online in the next few days[9.4:3.4]despite rising concerns as to its true purpose.[17.8:3.7]FutureTech may have fooled the rest of the world into letting them build this machine,[21.5:1.4]but we know the truth.[23.4:3]With this new device, that deceitful President Thornley[26.4:2.2]could debilitate the Soviet Union forever.[29:2.7]We cannot let this Sigma Harmonizer go online.[32:1.2]You must stop them,[33.5:3.4]or our future will be extinguished."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_01
	"[1.5:4.4]I can assure you that FutureTech's Board of Directors knew nothing[6.1:2.8]of Thornley's personal involvement in the Harmonizer project.[9.2:2.8]And to make sure nothing like this ever happens again,[12.2:3]we're putting in place additional security protocols.[15.4:5.8]FutureTech is committed to prosperity and the public good,[21.5:3.4]and we look forward to providing the world with a better tomorrow."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_02
	"[28.6:4.2]The Allied leaders have called to thank us for putting down this maniac Thornley.[33.4:1.8]In fact, as we speak,[35.1:5.5]they are pulling their forces from our territories so that they may increase security within their own.[40.6:2.4]We have gained their trust, comrade.[43.3:5.5]And now we will begin again to rebuild the glorious Union of Soviet Socialist Republics![49.8:2.7]The people thank you, Commander."
End

SUBTITLE:STH01DA01
	"[1.2:0.8]Commander.[2.4:2.4] Several recon teams are stationed around the area.[5.3:5.1]  Hopefully their combined reports will shed some light on what the Allies are trying to accomplish here."
End

SUBTITLE:STH01DA02
	"[0.9:2.4]I see you've met the Desolator Troopers.[3.7:2.1]They are masters of toxic weaponry.[6.2:5.6]They're not the most sophisticated of our forces, but they are quite deadly."
End

SUBTITLE:STH01DA03
	"[1.1:2.7]This is some sort of experimental Allied artillery.[4.4:1]Be careful."
End

SUBTITLE:STH01DA04
	"[2.2:3.9]Satellite reports indicate several large vehicles are closing in on your position.[6.5:3.9] Do not engage the enemy, you need to get those scientists to safety...[10.7:0.9]Go!"
End

SUBTITLE:STH01DA05
	"[2.9:2]This base isn't being run by the Allies,[5.3:2.1]it's being run by the FutureTech Corporation.[9.9:2] What could FutureTech want here?"
End

SUBTITLE:STH02DA01
	"[1.6:5.3]We know the FutureTech facility is across the river, but that’s the extent of our intelligence.[8:1.6]You'll need to get a closer look.[10.1:2.4]Avoid patrols as you make your way to the marker.[12.9:4.1]They are up to no good, I can feel it."
End

SUBTITLE:STH02DA02
	"[0.9:1.5]Those filthy animals…[2.9:1.8]experimenting on civilians![5:2.6]That'it. I’m sending in Kirovs![7.9:2.7]We will reduce that place to rubble!"
End

SUBTITLE:STH02DA03
	"[2.3:1.5]They're shooting down our Kirovs![5.9:1.1]Fall back, Commander.[6.9:2.7]Fall back to the village and I’ll send reinforcements.[10:2.6]FutureTech must be stopped!"
End

SUBTITLE:STH02DA04
	"[0.7:3]You have reinforcements, and the means to build up a base.[4.1:5.1]Launch a counterattack, Commander, and destroy their operations here."
End

SUBTITLE:STH02DA05
	"[1.5:2.1]You have a new addition to your arsenal[4.1:1.5] - the Mortar Cycle.[6:3.8]They are quite fast and able to outrange many enemies with their mortars,[10:3.2] so make good use of them."
End

SUBTITLE:STH02DA06
	"[1.1:1.4]Take pride, Comrade.[3:6]You have pushed this evil company out of our homeland and have liberated the people."
End

SUBTITLE:STH02TH01
	"[1.4:3]Your actions violate the terms of your country’s surrender.[5:5.4]FutureTech is in full cooperation with the Allied occupational authority.[10.4:5.4]Now, I'm authorizing the use of reinforcements to protect all FutureTech facilities.[16.4:2.4]Put down your arms, Commander.[18.8:2.8]This battle is over."
End

SUBTITLE:STH02TH02
	"[1.2:3.4]Your defeat today is a victory for free enterprise.[4.9:3.1]It proves that nothing can stop the tide of progress.[8:3.8]So either get with the program or get out of the way.[11.7:3.8]The future is coming, whether you like it or not."
End

SUBTITLE:STH03DA01
	"[1.8:4.3]This tropical paradise has a large FutureTech and Allied presence.[6.6:1.8] Advance cautiously.[9.2:4.5] I’m trying to get you some more help, but for now you’re on your own."
End

SUBTITLE:STH03DA02
	"[0.4:2.2]You will probably need more funds.[2.9:1.3]I’m working on it...[4.6:2.2]It should only be a matter of time…"
End

SUBTITLE:STH03DA03
	"[1.9:3.6]It appears that FutureTech is trying to harness the ability to[6.2:2.1]…stop time.[8.5:3.3] Or at least stop time for some objects, if not others.[12.4:6.4] It’s all very complicated, but apparently this technology is the basis for the Sigma Harmonizer!"
End

SUBTITLE:STH03TH01
	"[1.2:3.8]You just don't know how to keep your nose out of other people’s business, do you?[4.9:6.5]Well now, I'm going to have to show you what happens to those who are just a little too nosy."
End

SUBTITLE:STH03TH02
	"[1.1:2.9]You attack one of the most advanced research centers in the world,[4.1:2.9]and you think the doors will be wide open?[7.2:4]Heh. Surely you're a little smarter than that."
End

SUBTITLE:STH03TH03
	"[2:2.8]You really are a pest, aren't you?[5.1:4]Don't you understand, that when the Sigma Harmonizer becomes fully operational,[9.5:3.8]your little struggle here won't mean bupkuss?"
End

SUBTITLE:STH04DA01
	"[1.9:0.6]This is it.[3:2.2] The location of the Sigma Harmonizer.[7:3.4]  FutureTech has a massive base covering the island.[10.8:3.7] Before you can launch an attack, you will need to set up a base of your own.[15.4:0.9]  Be careful.[16.8:3.6]  As of now, they aren’t aware of your presence."
End

SUBTITLE:STH04DA02
	"[1.7:6.5]We have intel suggesting that FutureTech has assembly plants in operation, perhaps producing another advanced unit.[8.8:3.3]  You must destroy these assembly plants, but tread lightly.[12.5:1.9] We don't want to alert them."
End

SUBTITLE:STH04DA03
	"[1.5:1.1]There it is, Commander.[2.8:1.3] The Sigma Harmonizer![4.4:5.1]You’ll need to destroy it before President Thornley has it completely operational."
End

SUBTITLE:STH04DA04
	"[1.8:1.7]That is the last of the assembly plants![4.1:5.1]Good work, but now you’ll need to focus on the Sigma Harmonizer before it can be activated!"
End

SUBTITLE:STH04DA05
	"[1.5:1.8]That is the last of the assembly plants![3.8:6.6]Good work, but now you’ll need to focus on the Sigma Harmonizer before it stops time again!"
End

SUBTITLE:STH04DA06
	"[1.3:1.4]Hurry, Commander![2.7:3.9]The longer you take, the longer the Sigma Harmonizer can stop time!"
End

SUBTITLE:STH04DA07
	"[2.1:2.1]Those Future Tanks are too powerful, Commander.[4.7:3.8]We have one more ace up our sleeve, and it is time to pull it out.[8.9:5.9] I’m sending you The Grinder, use them to grind those Future Tanks down to scraps."
End

SUBTITLE:STH04TH01
	"[1:3]Oh, such a pity.[4:2.3]You almost had me, but you lost.[6.6:2.2]And you will continue to be lost...[9.5:3.2]Lost in time."
End

SUBTITLE:STH04TH02
	"[1.2:1.1]You better hurry, Commander![2.3:3.8]Or else I’m going push the button and freeze your forces like a photograph.[6.4:0.8] And then![7.1:2.7]I'll come after you."
End

SUBTITLE:STH04TH03
	"[1.4:1.1]No![2.5:2.3] What have you done, you idiot![4.8:2.3] I could have created heaven on Earth here.[7.1:1.5] Now, now...![8.6:-217.5] ...I have nothing..."
End

SUBTITLE:YFS01_01
	"[1.5:3.4]Tonight for our special report, Brenda Snow is here with an exclusive[5.1:3.7]on the powerful and elusive Yuriko Omega.  Brenda?"
End

SUBTITLE:YFS01_02
	"[9.4:4.6]Thanks Ted.  By now you may have heard the stories of Yuriko Omega,[14.2:3.9]the mysterious Japanese girl with the terrifying psionic powers.[18.1:3.2]During the war, Allied soldiers claimed that she decimated[21.2:3.6]entire combat battalions using only her mind.[24.8:3]Who is this young girl? Where did she come from?[27.8:4]And how did she develop these fearsome and fantastic abilities?[31.8:2.4]Yuriko's history is somewhat murky.[34.2:3.3]Some sources say that her real name is Yuriko Matsui,[37.6:3.6]and that Omega is simply a code name used by the military.[41.2:4.9]According to these same sources she was born in the small coastal town of Tanabe[46.1:3.9]and exhibited paranormal powers from the time she was very young."
End

SUBTITLE:YFS01_03
	"[50.5:3]There are indications that she was scorned by her schoolmates[53.5:1.7]because of her unique abilities.[55.2:2]When the government learned of these talents,[57.2:3.2]she was taken away to the Shiro Psychic Research Center,[60.4:3.7]run by this man... Dr. Shinji Shimada.[64.6:3.6]He's widely known for his advances in the area of psionic research.[68.2:2.8]What did the scientists at the Shiro Research center[71:2.8]do to this confused, lonely little girl?[73.8:1.9]We may never know exactly,[75.6:2.9]but whatever it was, she was never the same again."
End

SUBTITLE:YFS02_01
	"[1.3:4.2]Welcome back to our special report on Yuriko Omega.[5.7:4]During the war, Yuriko was used by the Empire's military machine.[9.7:3.7]Her psionic powers made her one of the most dangerous weapons[13.4:1.6]in the Empire's arsenal.[15.3:3.4]Her reign of terror ended when Allied forces invaded Tokyo.[19.2:3.7]Yuriko was  found unconscious, under the rubble of the Imperial Palace,[22.9:1.6]and taken into custody.[24.8:4]Transported back to the west, she was kept in complete isolation[28.8:3.7]in a high security compound deep in the jungles of Guam..."
End

SUBTITLE:YFS03_01
	"[1.3:4.7]Allied military officials still refuse to comment on the disastrous events[6:1.9]which followed Yuriko's detainment.[8.1:4.1]We do know this though… Yuriko Omega was nowhere to be found[12.3:1.9]and is now assumed to be on the run.[14.7:1]Where could she go?[16.1:2]If the military knows, they aren't saying.[18.4:1.8]One thing is certain, however.[20.2:3.9]Sometime, somewhere, she will reveal herself.[24.1:4.3]And when she does, hundreds, thousands, possibly millions[28.4:2.2]will be in very grave danger."
End

SUBTITLE:YFS03_02
	"[31.9:2.6]So do they think she's trying to get back to Japan?"
End

SUBTITLE:YFS03_03
	"[35:1.9]No one knows, Ted.[36.9:2.8]Since her escape, there has been no sign of her whatsoever."
End

SUBTITLE:YFS03_04
	"[39.9:2.6]Okay, well, thank you for that, Brenda. Fascinating.[43.1:3.6]Now we go to Molly McFarland, who's at Sunshine Mall,[46.7:3.3]covering the grand opening of a brand new Putt Putt golf course."
End

SUBTITLE:YTH01IZ01
	"[0.3:0.9]Yuriko…[1.2:0.9]wake up![2.1:2.9]You must break free of this place."
End

SUBTITLE:YTH01IZ02
	"[0.9:2.1]I am Izumi, your sister.[3.5:1.6]You must listen to me![5.5:3.2]You can be more powerful than you can imagine, Yuriko.[9.3:5.4]Use your powers and develop them, and more powers will come!"
End

SUBTITLE:YTH01IZ03
	"[1.4:1.6]You’re more than they can handle now.[3.3:1.1]Find your way out![4.3:2.7]Find your way to freedom!"
End

SUBTITLE:YTH01IZ04
	"[1.1:1.4]You’re more than they can handle now.[2.9:1.1]Now you must help me![4.3:3.4]Find me so we can both be free!"
End

SUBTITLE:YTH01SH01
	"[2:2.3]I see you’ve been snooping in the computers.[4.7:2] Clever girl, Yuriko.[7.2:1.6]I am Dr. Shimada.[9.5:1.7] You must not leave yet.[11.5:2.3] It is too dangerous."
End

SUBTITLE:YTH01SH02
	"[0.8:2.8]Yuriko, please, stop.[4.3:2.3] I cannot allow you to leave like this.[7.3:2.1] I know you are confused…[9.8:3.5]I can explain everything."
End

SUBTITLE:YTH01SH03
	"[1.1:1.6]Please, don’t do this.[3.1:1.5]We’re not trying to hurt you.[4.6:2.8]We’re trying to help you!"
End

SUBTITLE:YTH01SH04
	"[1.2:1.3]I’m sorry, Yuriko...[2.8:1.4] It was the only way![4.9:2.1]Why did you have to turn against me?[7.5:3.1] There was nothing else I could do!"
End

SUBTITLE:YTH02IZ01
	"[1.3:2.7]Yuriko, you must escape!"
End

SUBTITLE:YTH02IZ02
	"[0.8:1.8]He did this to you, Yuriko.[3.4:1.9]Dr. Shimada turned you into this.[5.7:3.9]Because of him, you will always be hunted.[10.2:2.1]Always!"
End

SUBTITLE:YTH02IZ03
	"[1.4:2.9]You can’t let Dr. Shimada get away with this, Yuriko.[4.8:1.9] You must break free and return.[7.2:2.8]Return to punish him."
End

SUBTITLE:YTH02IZ04
	"[1.1:0.9]See?[2.3:2.3]You are so powerful, Yuriko![4.9:3.6]So powerful that they cannot stop you."
End

SUBTITLE:YTH02IZ05
	"[1.3:0.6]Yuriko.[2.2:1.5]What Dr. Shimada did to you…[4:1.5]he did the same to me![6:5.4]Help free me, Yuriko! Help me."
End

SUBTITLE:YTH03IZ01
	"[1.3:0.6]Yuriko![2.2:3]You are so close now!"
End

SUBTITLE:YTH03IZ02
	"[1.3:0.7]Don’t give up...[2.1:2.3]you are almost there."
End

SUBTITLE:YTH03IZ03
	"[1.1:1.3]I’m free.[2.8:1.7]I’m finally free![5:1.2]Oh thank you!"
End

SUBTITLE:YTH03IZ04
	"[1.4:1.4]Keep trying, Yuriko![3.2:3.3]One of these elevators must be the way!"
End

SUBTITLE:YTH03IZ05
	"[1.2:2.7]My powers... they are returning![5.5:1.4]And now for you.[7.2:2.6]You weren't always the most powerful one.[10.1:3.9]Before Shimada imprisoned me, before he tried to control me...[14.3:1.3] I was the strongest.[16.2:3.4]And I will be again!"
End

SUBTITLE:YTH03SH01
	"[1:3.4]Yuriko, you shouldn’t have come back.[4.9:1.1]Now...[6.6:3.4]now I have to stop you."
End

SUBTITLE:YTH03SH02
	"[2.5:2.9]You have left me no choice, my sweet child.[5.9:3.6] I have to destroy you to prevent any more harm."
End

SUBTITLE:YTH03SH03
	"[1.5:1.6]Why are you doing this?[3.6:2.3] I stopped Izumi, and I’ll stop you, too.[6.6:2.3] Do you really think anyone will let you go?"
End

SUBTITLE:YTH03SH04
	"[1.1:1.2]You…[3:2.2]You have no idea what you've done.[6.6:1.4] I created both of you.[8.5:1.1]You are one and the same![9.6:2.4] You both crave power.[13:0.9]When I am gone,[14.2:4.9]there will be no one to protect you anymore."
End

